te component code grounded in Progress® Kendo UI® docs and APIs, while the Agent build\\n\\n---\\n\\nTitle: FREE AI Angular Code Generator Online - Revolutionize Your Web Development\\nURL: https://workik.com/angular-code-generator\\nCode/Highlights:\\nFREE AI Angular Code Generator Online - Revolutionize Your Web Development\\n\\nHome Features Pricing Tutorials Contact Logout\\n\\n[Dashboard](https://workik\\n\\n---\\n\\nTitle: Angular Overview - Kendo UI for Angular\\nURL: https://telerik.com/kendo-angular-ui/components/ai-assistant\\nCode/Highlights:\\nAngular Overview - Kendo UI for Angular\\n\\n×\\n\\nAI Tools / Overview\\n\\nNew to Kendo UI for Angular? Start a free 30-day trial # Kendo UI for Angular AI Tools Overview\\n\\nUpdated on Feb 27, 2026\\n\\nThe\\n\\n---\\n\\nTitle: Angular Agentic UI Generator Getting Started - Kendo UI for Angular\\nURL: https://www.telerik.com/kendo-angular-ui/components/ai-tools/agentic-ui-generator/getting-started\\nCode/Highlights:\\nAngular Agentic UI Generator Getting Started - Kendo UI for Angular\\n\\n× AI Tools / Agentic UI Generator/ [Getting Started](https://www.telerik.com/kendo-angular-ui/components/ai-tools/agentic-ui-gene\\n\\n---\\n\\nTitle: Build Great Angular Create new Components Faster Using AI Tools\\nURL: https://purecode.ai/components/angular/create%20new\\nCode/Highlights:\\nBuild Great Angular Create new Components Faster Using AI Tools # Build Angular Create%20news 50% faster with PureCode AI Generate custom Angular Create%20news - use your codebase as context in VS Code\\n\\n|\\n\\n|\\n\\n### Featured Generations Discover all\\n\\n## Explore our We\\n\\n---\\n\\nTitle: Build Great Angular Text editor tool Components Faster Using AI Tools\\nURL: https://purecode.ai/components/angular/text-editor-tool\\nCode/Highlights:\\nBuild Great Angular Text editor tool Components Faster Using AI Tools # Build Angular Text Editor Tools 50% faster with PureCode AI Generate custom Angular Text Editor Tools - use your codebase as context in VS Code\\n\\n|\\n\\n|\\n\\n### Featured Generations Discover all\\n\\n##\",\"metadata\":{\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"Code search: AI code generation tools Angular component generator 2024 2025\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774940532213,\"end\":1774940533447}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774940533451,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42b332c700230Vejt77sBbqDk\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42b2ecee001KEahXdqQk0uY2E\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":34298,\"input\":846,\"output\":172,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":33280}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774940606194,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42b44eef001TAJ4zANmQsjOVR\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42b332cb001z3bzPCaahx4hrr\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774940607357,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42b44ef1001IZKPMSnS32TlHC\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42b332cb001z3bzPCaahx4hrr\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"write\",\"callID\":\"call_function_bb25tci4xxel_1\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"content\":\"# Angular AI Component Generator - Requirements Document\\n\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\n\\nThis document outlines the requirements for building an Angular AI Component Generator - a tool that uses AI to automatically generate Angular components based on natural language descriptions or design inputs.\\n\\n## 2. Problem Statement\\n\\n- Developers spend significant time writing repetitive Angular boilerplate code\\n- Manual component creation is error-prone and time-consuming\\n- Need for consistent, production-ready Angular components following best practices\\n\\n## 3. Target Users\\n\\n- Frontend Angular developers\\n- Full-stack developers working with Angular\\n- Development teams wanting to accelerate Angular development\\n\\n## 4. Existing Tools Analysis\\n\\n### 4.1 Claude Code ( Anthropic )\\n- **Type**: AI coding assistant with CLI\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware code generation, sub-agent task delegation, persistent memory\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, via natural language prompts\\n\\n### 4.2 Kendo UI AI Assistant (Telerik)\\n- **Type**: MCP Server + Agent for Angular\\n- **Strengths**: Grounded in Kendo UI docs, agentic UI generation\\n- **Output**: Production-ready Kendo UI components\\n\\n### 4.3 PureCode AI\\n- **Type**: VS Code extension\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware using codebase, custom component generation\\n- **Output**: 50% faster component creation\\n\\n### 4.4 Workik AI\\n- **Type**: Online AI code generator\\n- **Strengths**: Free, multi-language support\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, online generator\\n\\n### 4.5 Kigumi\\n- **Type**: Framework wrapper generator\\n- **Strengths**: Idiomatic wrappers for Web Awesome components\\n\\n## 5. Feature Requirements\\n\\n### 5.1 Core Features (Must Have)\\n\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\n| Natural Language Input | Generate components from text descriptions | Critical |\\n| Component Type Selection | Support for: Component, Directive, Pipe, Service, Module | Critical |\\n| Template Generation | Generate .html templates with proper Angular syntax | Critical |\\n| TypeScript Support | Full TypeScript with proper typing | Critical |\\n| SCSS/CSS Generation | Component styling with SCSS | Critical |\\n| OnPush Change Detection | Default to OnPush strategy | High |\\n| Dependency Injection | Proper Injectable service pattern | High |\\n| Input/Output Decorators | Auto-generate @Input/@Output | High |\\n\\n### 5.2 Advanced Features (Should Have)\\n\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\n| File Structure Generation | Create folder structure with index.ts, .spec.ts | Medium |\\n| Kendo UI Integration | Generate Kendo UI components | Medium |\\n| Ng-Zorro Integration | Generate Ant Design Angular components | Medium |\\n| Testing Boilerplate | Generate .spec.ts with basic tests | Medium |\\n| Routing Support | Generate routed components with children | Low |\\n\\n### 5.3 Technical Approach Options\\n\\n**Option A: CLI-based Agent**\\n- Integrates with Claude Code / Cursor\\n- Uses natural language prompts\\n- Pros: Easy to implement, flexible\\n- Cons: Depends on external AI\\n\\n**Option B: MCP Server (Kendo UI style)**\\n- Custom MCP server for Angular\\n- Grounded in Angular best practices\\n- Pros: Specialized, consistent output\\n- Cons: Requires MCP setup\\n\\n**Option C: VS Code Extension**\\n- Embed AI generation directly in IDE\\n- Context-aware using workspace\\n- Pros: Tight integration, offline capable\\n- Cons: Complex development\\n\\n## 6. Recommended Approach\\n\\n**Recommended**: Option A (CLI-based Agent) with Option B enhancements\\n\\n- Start with Claude Code integration for natural language input\\n- Add custom prompt templates for Angular-specific patterns\\n- Generate output following EMS Finance / Angular 12 conventions\\n- Support Kendo UI and Ng-Zorro component libraries\\n\\n## 7. Technical Stack Recommendations\\n\\n- **AI Provider**: Claude Code 2.5 (latest with sub-agent support)\\n- **Output Format**: Angular 12+ with OnPush, strict typing\\n- **UI Libraries**: Kendo UI, Ng-Zorro (Ant Design)\\n- **Architecture**: 4-layer (data-access/service/feature/ui)\\n\\n## 8. Success Metrics\\n\\n- Reduce component creation time by 70%\\n- Generate production-ready code with 0 lint errors\\n- Support all major Angular component types\\n- Integrate with existing Angular best practices\\n\\n## 9. Next Steps\\n\\n1. Create prototype with Claude Code integration\\n2. Define Angular-specific prompt templates\\n3. Test with real-world component generation\\n4. Iterate based on developer feedback\\n5. Add Kendo UI / Ng-Zorro support\\n\\n---\\n\\n*Research completed by: GitHub Manager*\\n*Date: 2026-03-31*\",\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\requirements.md\"},\"output\":\"Wrote file successfully.\",\"metadata\":{\"diagnostics\":{},\"filepath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\requirements.md\",\"exists\":false,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\projects\\\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\\\_default\\\\requirements.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774940606193,\"end\":1774940607352}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774940607357,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42b45379001kgo5QtIM0HZrMs\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42b332cb001z3bzPCaahx4hrr\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":36067,\"input\":822,\"output\":1133,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":34112}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774940671507,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42b54e0e001ZsD371KKV5GiAF\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42b4537d001w1Ne6Zj0IcOIsx\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774940671512,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d42b54e11001l5hXz1BWqJLrW9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d42b4537d001w1Ne6Zj0IcOIsx\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"write\",\"callID\":\"call_function_pcv3ohryekzp_1\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"complete