{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1774940750718,"sessionID":"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa","part":{"id":"prt_d42b678c9001QhQ6PX55Yo7zkA","messageID":"msg_d42b60751001u8iQ0diEI1P7SD","sessionID":"ses_2bd50c401ffeORTEQ6kd4b7ASa","type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_function_l7n45cf2qk4a_1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"C:\\Users\\THANHSANG\\.paperclip\\instances\\default\\projects\\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\\_default\\doc_put.ps1\"","description":"Create requirements document"},"output":"{\r\n    \"id\":  \"503bbd15-df94-4468-b21b-47e8e826dfde\",\r\n    \"companyId\":  \"c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\",\r\n    \"issueId\":  \"92626738-cd5a-4564-9031-ce6e4ce8dfd3\",\r\n    \"key\":  \"requirements\",\r\n    \"title\":  \"Requirements\",\r\n    \"format\":  \"markdown\",\r\n    \"body\":  \"# Angular AI Component Generator - Requirements Document\\n\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\n\\nThis document outlines the requirements for building an Angular AI Component Generator - a tool that uses AI to automatically generate Angular components based on natural language descriptions or design inputs.\\n\\n## 2. Problem Statement\\n\\n- Developers spend significant time writing repetitive Angular boilerplate code\\n- Manual component creation is error-prone and time-consuming\\n- Need for consistent, production-ready Angular components following best practices\\n\\n## 3. Target Users\\n\\n- Frontend Angular developers\\n- Full-stack developers working with Angular\\n- Development teams wanting to accelerate Angular development\\n\\n## 4. Existing Tools Analysis\\n\\n### 4.1 Claude Code ( Anthropic )\\n- **Type**: AI coding assistant with CLI\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware code generation, sub-agent task delegation, persistent memory\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, via natural language prompts\\n\\n### 4.2 Kendo UI AI Assistant (Telerik)\\n- **Type**: MCP Server + Agent for Angular\\n- **Strengths**: Grounded in Kendo UI docs, agentic UI generation\\n- **Output**: Production-ready Kendo UI components\\n\\n### 4.3 PureCode AI\\n- **Type**: VS Code extension\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware using codebase, custom component generation\\n- **Output**: 50% faster component creation\\n\\n### 4.4 Workik AI\\n- **Type**: Online AI code generator\\n- **Strengths**: Free, multi-language support\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, online generator\\n\\n### 4.5 Kigumi\\n- **Type**: Framework wrapper generator\\n- **Strengths**: Idiomatic wrappers for Web Awesome components\\n\\n## 5. Feature Requirements\\n\\n### 5.1 Core Features (Must Have)\\n\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\n| Natural Language Input | Generate components from text descriptions | Critical |\\n| Component Type Selection | Support for: Component, Directive, Pipe, Service, Module | Critical |\\n| Template Generation | Generate .html templates with proper Angular syntax | Critical |\\n| TypeScript Support | Full TypeScript with proper typing | Critical |\\n| SCSS/CSS Generation | Component styling with SCSS | Critical |\\n| OnPush Change Detection | Default to OnPush strategy | High |\\n| Dependency Injection | Proper Injectable service pattern | High |\\n| Input/Output Decorators | Auto-generate @Input/@Output | High |\\n\\n### 5.2 Advanced Features (Should Have)\\n\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\n| File Structure Generation | Create folder structure with index.ts, .spec.ts | Medium |\\n| Kendo UI Integration | Generate Kendo UI components | Medium |\\n| Ng-Zorro Integration | Generate Ant Design Angular components | Medium |\\n| Testing Boilerplate | Generate .spec.ts with basic tests | Medium |\\n| Routing Support | Generate routed components with children | Low |\\n\\n### 5.3 Technical Approach Options\\n\\n**Option A: CLI-based Agent**\\n- Integrates with Claude Code / Cursor\\n- Uses natural language prompts\\n- Pros: Easy to implement, flexible\\n- Cons: Depends on external AI\\n\\n**Option B: MCP Server (Kendo UI style)**\\n- Custom MCP server for Angular\\n- Grounded in Angular best practices\\n- Pros: Specialized, consistent output\\n- Cons: Requires MCP setup\\n\\n**Option C: VS Code Extension**\\n- Embed AI generation directly in IDE\\n- Context-aware using workspace\\n- Pros: Tight integration, offline capable\\n- Cons: Complex development\\n\\n## 6. Recommended Approach\\n\\n**Recommended**: Option A (CLI-based Agent) with Option B enhancements\\n\\n- Start with Claude Code integration for natural language input\\n- Add custom prompt templates for Angular-specific patterns\\n- Generate output following EMS Finance / Angular 12 conventions\\n- Support Kendo UI and Ng-Zorro component libraries\\n\\n## 7. Technical Stack Recommendations\\n\\n- **AI Provider**: Claude Code 2.5 (latest with sub-agent support)\\n- **Output Format**: Angular 12+ with OnPush, strict typing\\n- **UI Libraries**: Kendo UI, Ng-Zorro (Ant Design)\\n- **Architecture**: 4-layer (data-access/service/feature/ui)\\n\\n## 8. Success Metrics\\n\\n- Reduce component creation time by 70%\\n- Generate production-ready code with 0 lint errors\\n- Support all major Angular component types\\n- Integrate with existing Angular best practices\\n\\n## 9. Next Steps\\n\\n1. Create prototype with Claude Code integration\\n2. Define Angular-specific prompt templates\\n3. Test with real-world component generation\\n4. Iterate based on developer feedback\\n5. Add Kendo UI / Ng-Zorro support\\n\\n---\\n*Research completed by: GitHub Manager*\\n*Date: 2026-03-31*\",\r\n    \"latestRevisionId\":  \"f57d2871-8542-41c3-8d79-d67ca226263c\",\r\n    \"latestRevisionNumber\":  1,\r\n    \"createdByAgentId\":  \"8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9\",\r\n    \"createdByUserId\":  null,\r\n    \"updatedByAgentId\":  \"8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9\",\r\n    \"updatedByUserId\":  null,\r\n    \"createdAt\":  \"2026-03-31T07:05:50.509Z\",\r\n    \"updatedAt\":  \"2026-03-31T07:05:50.509Z\"\r\n}\r\n","metadata":{"output":"{\r\n    \"id\":  \"503bbd15-df94-4468-b21b-47e8e826dfde\",\r\n    \"companyId\":  \"c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\",\r\n    \"issueId\":  \"92626738-cd5a-4564-9031-ce6e4ce8dfd3\",\r\n    \"key\":  \"requirements\",\r\n    \"title\":  \"Requirements\",\r\n    \"format\":  \"markdown\",\r\n    \"body\":  \"# Angular AI Component Generator - Requirements Document\\n\\n## 1. Executive Summary\\n\\nThis document outlines the requirements for building an Angular AI Component Generator - a tool that uses AI to automatically generate Angular components based on natural language descriptions or design inputs.\\n\\n## 2. Problem Statement\\n\\n- Developers spend significant time writing repetitive Angular boilerplate code\\n- Manual component creation is error-prone and time-consuming\\n- Need for consistent, production-ready Angular components following best practices\\n\\n## 3. Target Users\\n\\n- Frontend Angular developers\\n- Full-stack developers working with Angular\\n- Development teams wanting to accelerate Angular development\\n\\n## 4. Existing Tools Analysis\\n\\n### 4.1 Claude Code ( Anthropic )\\n- **Type**: AI coding assistant with CLI\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware code generation, sub-agent task delegation, persistent memory\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, via natural language prompts\\n\\n### 4.2 Kendo UI AI Assistant (Telerik)\\n- **Type**: MCP Server + Agent for Angular\\n- **Strengths**: Grounded in Kendo UI docs, agentic UI generation\\n- **Output**: Production-ready Kendo UI components\\n\\n### 4.3 PureCode AI\\n- **Type**: VS Code extension\\n- **Strengths**: Context-aware using codebase, custom component generation\\n- **Output**: 50% faster component creation\\n\\n### 4.4 Workik AI\\n- **Type**: Online AI code generator\\n- **Strengths**: Free, multi-language support\\n- **Angular Support**: Yes, online generator\\n\\n### 4.5 Kigumi\\n- **Type**: Framework wrapper generator\\n- **Strengths**: Idiomatic wrappers for Web Awesome components\\n\\n## 5. Feature Requirements\\n\\n### 5.1 Core Features (Must Have)\\n\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\n| Natural Language Input | Generate components from text descriptions | Critical |\\n| Component Type Selection | Support for: Component, Directive, Pipe, Service, Module | Critical |\\n| Template Generation | Generate .html templates with proper Angular syntax | Critical |\\n| TypeScript Support | Full TypeScript with proper typing | Critical |\\n| SCSS/CSS Generation | Component styling with SCSS | Critical |\\n| OnPush Change Detection | Default to OnPush strategy | High |\\n| Dependency Injection | Proper Injectable service pattern | High |\\n| Input/Output Decorators | Auto-generate @Input/@Output | High |\\n\\n### 5.2 Advanced Features (Should Have)\\n\\n| Feature | Description | Priority |\\n|---------|-------------|----------|\\n| File Structure Generation | Create folder structure with index.ts, .spec.ts | Medium |\\n| Kendo UI Integration | Generate Kendo UI components | Medium |\\n| Ng-Zorro Integration | Generate Ant Design Angular components | Medium |\\n| Testing Boilerplate | Generate .spec.ts with basic tests | Medium |\\n| Routing Support | Generate routed components with children | Low |\\n\\n### 5.3 Technical Approach Options\\n\\n**Option A: CLI-based Agent**\\n- Integrates with Claude Code / Cursor\\n- Uses natural language prompts\\n- Pros: Easy to implement, flexible\\n- Cons: Depends on external AI\\n\\n**Option B: MCP Server (Kendo UI style)**\\n- Custom MCP server for Angular\\n- Grounded in Angular best practices\\n- Pros: Specialized, consistent output\\n- Cons: Requires MCP setup\\n\\n**Option C: VS Code Extension**\\n- Embed AI generation directly in IDE\\n- Context-aware using workspace\\n- Pros: Tight integration, offline capable\\n- Cons: Complex development\\n\\n## 6. Recommended Approach\\n\\n**Recommended**: Option A (CLI-based Agent) with Option B enhancements\\n\\n- Start with Claude Code integration for natural language input\\n- Add custom prompt templates for Angular-specific patterns\\n- Generate output following EMS Finance / Angular 12 conventions\\n- Support Kendo UI and Ng-Zorro component libraries\\n\\n## 7. Technical Stack Recommendations\\n\\n- **AI Provider**: Claude Code 2.5 (latest with sub-agent support)\\n- **Output Format**: Angular 12+ with OnPush, strict typing\\n- **UI Libraries**: Kendo UI, Ng-Zorro (Ant Design)\\n- **Architecture**: 4-layer (data-access/service/feature/ui)\\n\\n## 8. Success Metrics\\n\\n- Reduce component creation time by 70%\\n- Generate production-ready code with 0 lint errors\\n- Support all major Angular component types\\n- Integrate with existing Angular best practices\\n\\n## 9. Next Steps\\n\\n1. Create prototype with Claude Code integration\\n2. Define Angular-specific prompt templates\\n3. Test with real-world component generation\\n4. Iterate based on developer feedback\\n5. Add Kendo UI / Ng-Zorro support\\n\\n---\\n*Research completed by: GitHub Manager*\\n*Date: 2026-03-31*\",\r\n    \"latestRevisionId\":  \"f57d2871-8542-41c3-8d79-d67ca226263c\",\r\n    \"latestRevisionNumber\":  1,\r\n    \"createdByAgentId\":  \"8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9\",\r\n    \"createdByUserId\":  null,\r\n    \"updatedByAgentId\":  \"8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9\",\r\n    \"updatedByUserId\":  null,\r\n    \"createdAt\":  \"2026-03-31T07:05:50.509Z\",\r\n    \"updatedAt\":  \"2026-03-31T07:05:50.509Z\"\r\n}\r\n","exit":0,"description":"Create requirements document","truncated":false},"title":"Create requirements document","time":{"start":1774940747978,"end":1774940750713}}}}
