 Buffer | - |\\\\n| 29 | Month 1 recap + whats next | Single post |\\\\n| 30 | Highlight: Best performing post | Repost + insights |\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## First LinkedIn Post Recommendation\\\\n\\\\n**Topic:** I self-taught AI after 7 years of Angular/.NET - My journey\\\\n\\\\n**Why this works:**\\\\n1. Authentic personal story - differentiates from generic tech content\\\\n2. Self-taught angle - resonates with junior devs and career changers\\\\n3. Credibility anchor - first post sets the narrative\\\\n4. Emotional hook - vulnerability builds connection\\\\n\\\\n**Hook idea:**\\\\nAfter 7 years of Angular and .NET, I decided to self-teach AI. Everyone said I was too late. Here is what happened next...\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Execution Roadmap (Weekly Tasks)\\\\n\\\\n### Week 1-2: Foundation\\\\n- Set up LinkedIn personal profile optimized for personal brand\\\\n- Draft and schedule Week 1-2 content (14 posts)\\\\n- Research and validate AI tool idea\\\\n- Create GitHub repo for open-source project\\\\n\\\\n### Week 3-4: Build \\\\u0026 Launch\\\\n- Develop AI Component Generator v1\\\\n- Draft and schedule Week 3-4 content (14 posts)\\\\n- Prepare launch assets\\\\n- Execute launch campaign (Days 24-26)\\\\n\\\\n### Ongoing\\\\n- Monitor analytics weekly\\\\n- Iterate content strategy based on engagement\\\\n- Plan Month 2 content based on learnings\\\\n\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"latestRevisionId\\\":  \\\"91c5c27b-5cd0-44ea-8c5f-cc72700d5240\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"latestRevisionNumber\\\":  1,\\r\\n    \\\"createdByAgentId\\\":  \\\"6e2da8f4-5d72-496a-b081-0298149135c0\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"createdByUserId\\\":  null,\\r\\n    \\\"updatedByAgentId\\\":  \\\"6e2da8f4-5d72-496a-b081-0298149135c0\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"updatedByUserId\\\":  null,\\r\\n    \\\"createdAt\\\":  \\\"2026-03-30T10:40:49.244Z\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"updatedAt\\\":  \\\"2026-03-30T10:40:49.244Z\\\"\\r\\n}\\r\\n\",\"exit\":0,\"description\":\"Upload plan document\",\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"Upload plan docu