vIQ9evSJQ84iA\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b93085f3ffeXZpvab56D9vo0M\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"webfetch\",\"callID\":\"tooluse_ezzy5C8OTWdtQ7SbReLUuR\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"format\":\"markdown\",\"url\":\"https://elevenlabs.io/affiliates\"},\"output\":\"Earn with ElevenLabs — Join Our Affiliate Program Today\\n\\n[Skip to content](#content)\\n\\n-   [](/)\\n-   -   [ElevenCreative](/creative)\\n    -   [ElevenAgents](/agents)\\n    -   [ElevenAPI](/api)\\n    -   Resources\\n        \\n    -   [\\n        \\n        Enterprise\\n        \\n        ](/enterprise)\\n    -   [\\n        \\n        Pricing\\n        \\n        ](/pricing)\\n\\n[Log in](/app/sign-in)[Sign up](/app/sign-up)\\n\\n[Contact sales](/contact-sales)[Go to app](/app/home)\\n\\n[\\n\\n](/)\\n\\n-   [Instant sign up](/app/home?affiliate=true)[Instant sign up](/app/home?affiliate=true)\\n\\n# Affiliates program\\n\\n## Become an affiliate and earn with every recommendation\\n\\nDo you love ElevenLabs? Are you interested in earning money by promoting ElevenLabs products? We're always on the lookout for passionate individuals to partner with on our affiliate program\\n\\n[Instant sign up](/app/home?affiliate=true)\\n\\n![Collage of five people working with audio equipment and using smartphones, with overlayed stats showing earnings and referral counts.](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Feleven-public-cdn.elevenlabs.io%2Fpayloadcms%2F74s1rpgqq4a-affiliates-3-removebg.webp&w=3840&q=95)\\n\\n-   ![A black silhouette of a person sitting at a desk with a computer, surrounded by books and a lamp.](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Feleven-public-cdn.elevenlabs.io%2Fpayloadcms%2Fc7i5pf89xcf-icon-rewards.png&w=3840&q=95)\\n    \\n    ### Rewarding referrals\\n    \\n    For every new paid subscriber plan, you’ll earn 22% of all payments for the first 12 months — with no limits!\\n    \\n-   ![A black silhouette of a person sitting at a desk with a computer, surrounded by books and a lamp.](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Feleven-public-cdn.elevenlabs.io%2Fpayloadcms%2Fbn0wefjbqow-icon-spread.png&w=3840&q=95)\\n    \\n    ### Spread the word\\n    \\n    Share ElevenLabs with your friends and followers - and help make content universally accessible.\\n    \\n-   ![A black silhouette of a person sitting at a desk with a computer, surrounded by books and a lamp.](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Feleven-public-cdn.elevenlabs.io%2Fpayloadcms%2Fv5yikhcz858-icon-track.png&w=3840&q=95)\\n    \\n    ### Transparent tracking\\n    \\n    Keep an eye on your earnings with our intuitive dashboard.\\n    \\n\\n## Start earning in 3 easy steps\\n\\n-   ![Alt text: A blurred blue and white background with a white oval containing the URL \\\"evelenlabs.io/?from=your-unique-URL\\\".](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Feleven-public-cdn.elevenlabs.io%2Fpayloadcms%2Fltxs6kvylcr-share-url.png&w=3840&q=95)\\n    \\n    ### Share\\n    \\n    Create content with your unique affiliate link on your channels. You’ll have access to promotional best practices, guides, and more.\\n    \\n-   ![A purple line graph with peaks and valleys on a white background.](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Feleven-public-cdn.elevenlabs.io%2Fpayloadcms%2F6tnfi9p2yb8-Track.png&w=3840&q=95)\\n    \\n    ### Subscribe\\n    \\n    With our intuitive dashboard, you can easily track the resonance of your message and ElevenLabs purchases.\\n    \\n-   ![You're getting paid!](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Feleven-public-cdn.elevenlabs.io%2Fpayloadcms%2Fsxffzfajb7-Paid.png&w=3840&q=95)\\n    \\n    ### Earn\\n    \\n    You will receive 22% of all payments from referrals for the first year of the subscription.\\n    \\n\\nUnmute\\n\\n## Affiliates media pack\\n\\nGet all the media resource you might need. Download the media pack or find out more in your affiliates dashboard.\\n\\n[Download Media Pack](https://storage.googleapis.com/eleven-public-cdn/affiliates/Affiliates%20Marketing%20Bundle.zip)\\n\\nUnmute\\n\\n## Creator affiliate program FAQ\\n\\n### How much can I earn as an affiliate?\\n\\nYour earning potential is limitless! We offer a competitive commission structure: earn 22% for the first 12 months on any paid customer you refer from our Starter, Creator, Pro, and Scale Plans, and 11% from our new Business Plan. The more you promote, the more you can earn.\\n\\nPlease note that we do not provide commission payouts for our enterprise level.\\n\\nHere's an example:\\n\\n10-person Creator Plan for 1-Year\\n\\n-   10 x $22 x 12 = $2,640.\\n-   You get paid $580.80\\n\\n20-person Pro for 1-Year\\n\\n-   20 x $99 x 12 = $23,760.\\n-   You get paid $5,227.20\\n\\n### How do I join the ElevenLabs Creator Affiliate Program?\\n\\nIt's straightforward! If you already have an ElevenLabs account simply sign in to the web app, click your avatar bottom left, Docs and Resources, Affiliate program. If you do not have an ElevenLabs account, sign up [here](/sign-up?redirect=/affiliates), you will be prompted to sign up with PartnerStack this is our third-party affiliate management platform. Once you’ve completed the onboarding with PartnerStack, you’ll be taken directly to your dashboard’s Home page, where you can access your link and start sharing.\\n\\n### When and how will I get paid?\\n\\nCommissions are paid through our third party partner Partnerstack. Please read more on their payment policies [here](https://support.partnerstack.com/hc/en-us/articles/360009501113-Getting-Paid-101). Commissions are paid after the license has been active for more than 90 days. For example, if someone you refer purchases a paid license on Feb 10th, that referral becomes 'active' on May 10th and you will be paid on the next payment period (in June). Our payment period happens between the 1st - 15th of each month.\\n\\n### What is the minimum payout threshold for the Creator Affiliate program?\\n\\nThe minimum payout threshold is $5.\\n\\n### How can I track my sales and commissions?\\n\\nYou can create, track, and promote your affiliate link by signing in to PartnerStack using the email sent to you when you generated your referral link.\\n\\n### Do I need to have a blog or website to join?\\n\\nWhile having a blog or website can be beneficial, you can also promote ElevenLabs through social media, email, or any other platforms you prefer. As long as you follow the guidelines dictated in our terms of service\\n\\n### Can I refer other affiliates and earn from their sales?\\n\\nOur primary focus is on product sales. Currently, we do not have a multi-tiered system where you earn from other affiliates' sales. But stay tuned for any updates on this!\\n\\n### What happens if a customer I referred requests a refund?\\n\\nAs an affiliate, you'll earn regular commission from a user as long as their paid subscription remains active during the first 12 months of sign-up. However, if a user cancels their plan, your monthly commission from their subscription will stop. Additionally, if a user requests a refund, your commission related to that purchase will not be paid or will be deducted from your following commission.\\n\\n### Who can I contact if I have more questions or need support?\\n\\nWe're here to help! You can reach out to our dedicated affiliate support team at [affiliates@elevenlabs.io](mailto:affiliates@elevenlabs.io) or through the contact form on our affiliate portal.\\n\\n### Can I earn commissions on my own purchases through my referral link?\\n\\nNo, affiliates are not eligible to earn commissions on their own purchases.\\n\\n### What is the cookie duration for my referral link?\\n\\nThe cookie duration is 90 days. This means if someone clicks on your referral link and makes a purchase within 90 days, you'll earn a commission for that sale.\\n\\n### Can I promote ElevenLabs internationally?\\n\\nElevenLabs is a global brand, and you can promote our products to audiences all over the world. However, we are only allowed to compensate commissions on sales where commissions are allowed.\\n\\n### How do I know if my promotional efforts are successful?\\n\\nYour affiliate dashboard provides comprehensive analytics, including click-through rates, conversion rates, and total sales. Monitoring these metrics will give you insights into your promotional efforts' effectiveness.\\n\\n### What methods of promotion are not allowed in the affiliate program?\\n\\nWe do not allow spamming, misleading advertising, or any promotional methods that violate our Terms and Conditions. Any activity that could harm the reputation of ElevenLabs is strictly prohibited.\\n\\nIn addition, bidding on ElevenLabs’ branded keywords or variations (including misspellings) on any search engine is not allowed. Affiliates found participating in branded paid search auctions will forfeit all payouts accrued during that period and will be immediately removed from the program.\\n\\n### Can I create a website or social media profile that impersonates ElevenLabs for promotion?\\n\\nNo, creating a website or social media profile that may confuse visitors into thinking it's the official ElevenLabs site or profile is strictly prohibited.\\n\\n### Are there any types of content or platforms where I can't promote ElevenLabs?\\n\\nAffiliates must not promote ElevenLabs on platforms or within content that is offensive, misleading, or in violation of any laws or community standards. This includes, but is not limited to, content that promotes hate, discrimination, or illegal activity.\\n\\nAdditionally, promotion through branded paid search (bidding on ElevenLabs’ name or related brand terms including misspellings) on any search engine is prohibited. This ensures fair competition and protects the integrity of ElevenLabs’ marketing efforts. Affiliates found participating in branded paid search auctions will forfeit all payouts accrued during that period and will be immediately removed from the program.\\n\\n### If I violate the promotional guidelines, what are the consequences?\\n\\nViolating the promotional guidelines may result in the suspension or termination of your affiliate account and forfeiture of any earned commissions.\\n\\n### What is Partnerstack and how does it relate to the ElevenLabs Creator Affiliate Program?\\n\\nPartnerstack is a platform dedicated to supporting partnership programs, enabling businesses to engage with affiliates, influencers, and resellers. As a member of the ElevenLabs Creator Affiliate Program, you'll use Partnerstack to monitor your earnings and analyze your performance metrics. Joining Partnerstack is a requisite for getting paid in this program. The platform offers an array of tools for tracking, management, and optimization of partnership-driven growth. It ensures smooth integration for affiliates and hassle-free commission disbursements. Numerous companies rely on Partnerstack to nurture and expand their partner ecosystems.\\n\\n### How do I promote ElevenLabs effectively?\\n\\nYou can promote ElevenLabs through a variety of channels, including your blog, social media platforms, YouTube channel, or even word of mouth. We provide promotional materials to help you here. Tailoring your message to your audience and sharing genuine experiences often yields the best results.\\n\\n### How should I go about tagging ElevenLabs on social media?\\n\\nThanks for the love! Here is a list of all our handles, including, [X](https://twitter.com/elevenlabsio), [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/elevenlabsio/), [Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-ew9TfeD887qUSiWWAAj1w), [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/company/elevenlabsio), and [Discord](https://discord.gg/elevenlabs).\\n\\n### Are there any promotional materials provided?\\n\\nYes, we provide a range of marketing materials such as banners, product images, and sample posts to make your promotion easier and more effective. You are able to view these resources on your PartnerStack dashboard. You can also access logos of ElevenLabs [here](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vq-8U0Ujdkzjyxm6_S-fHhgP-dSdmto8).\\n\\n### What are some guiding principles for promotion?\\n\\nHere are three principles to remember as you consider ways to promote your affiliate link for ElevenLabs:\\n\\nMaintain Authenticity: We've chosen you for this initiative because we recognize the synergy between you, your audience, and the ethos of ElevenLabs. Upholding authenticity in your promotions will resonate with your audience and bolster the image of ElevenLabs.\\n\\nTailor to Your Audience: You have the best understanding of your audience's preferences. Harness this knowledge! If your followers consist largely of tech enthusiasts, demonstrate the cutting-edge features of ElevenLabs. If they're audiophiles or professionals in the sound industry, showcase how ElevenLabs can revolutionize their audio experience. Ensure you're providing them with valuable insights tailored to their interests.\\n\\nMaximize Exposure: Success in this endeavor hinges on extensive reach. Disseminate your link across as many platforms as possible. Whether it's websites, social media, or video channels, diversifying your promotion avenues will help capture a wider audience spectrum.\\n\\nCreate with the highest quality AI Audio\\n\\n[Contact Sales](/contact-sales)[Sign up](/app/sign-up)\\n\\n[](/)\\n\\nEnglish\\n\\n-   [ElevenCreative](/creative)\\n    \\n    -   [Text to Speech](/text-to-speech)\\n    -   [Speech to Text](/speech-to-text)\\n    -   [Voice Changer](/voice-changer)\\n    -   [Text to Sound Effects](/sound-effects)\\n    -   [Voice Cloning](/voice-cloning)\\n    -   [Voice Isolator](/voice-isolator)\\n    -   [AI Music Generator](/music)\\n    -   [Studio](/studio)\\n    -   [Voice Design](/voice-design)\\n    -   [AI Voice Generator](/ai-voice-generator)\\n    -   [AI Image Generator](/image)\\n    -   [AI Video Generator](/video)\\n-   [ElevenAgents](/agents)\\n    \\n    -   [Voice Agents](/voice-agents)\\n    -   [Conversational AI](