 Comms Marketers\\n\\n![Smiling man with a mustache wearing an orange beanie and gray sweatshirt, resting his chin on his hand, against a blue pixelated and grid design background.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434d12053354f1598424ce_digital-person.webp)\\n\\nDigital\\n\\nPopular\\n\\nPress release\\n\\nShare key company news and updates with well-crafted press release.\\n\\nPublicly Available\\n\\nLaunch local campaigns at global speed.\\n\\nSolutions for Field Marketers\\n\\n[Solutions for Field Marketers](/solutions/by-role/field-marketers)Solutions for Field Marketers\\n\\n[Solutions for Field Marketers](/solutions/by-role/field-marketers)Solutions for Field Marketers\\n\\n![Smiling man with glasses wearing a mustard yellow shirt against a background of purple and lavender geometric shapes.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68455de88a938ca45063ba21_field-marketer.webp)\\n\\nField\\n\\nPopular\\n\\nLanding Page\\n\\nTransform site traffic into valuable leads through engaging landing pages.\\n\\nPublicly Available\\n\\n![Icon showing a woman’s photo inside a yellow circle with the text 'Product Marketer' and a cursor arrow pointing to the right.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434bb4b39b713a255f58ab_product-cursor.webp)\\n\\n![Smiling man next to a red label with white text reading 'Content Marketer' and a paper airplane icon.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434bb4314914781dd144d8_content%20-cursor.webp)\\n\\n![Brand Marketer text with an arrow cursor icon and a smiling man with glasses in a pink circle.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434bb470996bbb03440a26_brand-cursor.webp)\\n\\n![Illustration of a cursor arrow pointing to a blue label with text 'PR & Comms Marketer' accompanied by a smiling man wearing an orange beanie.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68455f5326534506568f7776_pr-coms-cursor.webp)\\n\\n![Profile photo of a woman with dark curly hair and glasses next to the text 'Performance Marketer' on a light green background.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434bb4ca21a22439da0197_performance%20-cursor.webp)\\n\\n![Smiling man wearing glasses and a mustard sweater next to a purple label reading 'Field Marketer' with a paper plane icon.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/684564d2444b9d1605ba54ba_6d39bebaeb605433d98da9fa2b38f8fc_field-cursor.webp)\\n\\nCustomer Stories\\n\\n## Proven strategies, real results\\n\\n[Explore Customer Stories](/customer-stories)Explore Customer Stories\\n\\nExplore Customer Stories\\n\\n[Case Studies - Cushman & Wakefield](/case-studies/cushman-wakefield)Case Studies - Cushman & Wakefield\\n\\n10,000+\\n\\nhours saved annually\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434c30ee3bba5948be8367_2d549165fe4b43347afc07dff02f9ba3_Stories%20Logo%20-%20Cushman.svg)\\n\\nCompliant,\\n\\nhigh-quality, and localized marketing content at scale\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434c30e8251447fe0c87f0_708a1d462a2988199822e30817c9baa3_Stories%20Logo%20-%20Opella.svg)\\n\\n![Close-up black and white portrait of a man wearing glasses and a collared shirt.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68474968a2d2ab267d560e7e_Peter%20So.avif)\\n\\nPeter So\\n\\nVP of Digital Innovation\\n\\n\\\"Thrilled to be on Jasper’s Customer Advisory Board. It’s not just about efficiency gains, it’s about augmenting human creativity, scaling expertise, and unlocking new ways to engage customers and drive business outcomes.\\\"\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434c30ee4940f4cf5f84b0_b26609be72643f9cce0d5a57530f5c51_Stories%20Logo%20-%20PGIM.svg)\\n\\n![Smiling woman with shoulder-length brown hair wearing a navy blue top against a dark grey background.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/684748286f2b284abb7b9dc2_elaina%20shekhter%20EPAM.avif)\\n\\nElaina Shekhter\\n\\nChief Marketing & Strategy Officer\\n\\n\\\"Our marketing teams have cracked the code of using Jasper as an agentic partner in our day-to-day lives, transforming how we work, collaborate and evolve as an organization.\\\"\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434c30690aaf4ef0d61f45_0d8b9599f905bb1bdf5103f40746e148_Stories%20Logo%20-%20EPAM.svg)\\n\\n60%\\n\\nof SEO now automated with Jasper\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434c30d01d8650b4b92d30_f7f189f737a49eb424391128b123192b_Stories%20Logo%20-%20Anthropologie.svg)\\n\\n[Adidas uses AI](/webinars/revolutionizing-retail-how-adidas-utilizes-ai-for-success)Adidas uses AI\\n\\n7,500\\n\\nproduct descriptions written by Jasper in 24 hours\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434c30357cc47cb090cbfa_15550a62b2d8c2da6699e58be3269970_Stories%20Logo%20-%20Adidas.svg)\\n\\n3x\\n\\ncontent production\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434c30bcb16d000ca9f73d_7f88cea7c36417b5414262de39afd726_Stories%20Logo%20-%20Avery%20Dennison.svg)\\n\\nTime-to-market\\n\\nFaster end-to-end campaigns\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434c30496f684d15abcbc9_16ae9a57f52c6c42eda80a0c9357e373_Stories%20Logo%20-%20Ulta.svg)\\n\\n![Portrait of a smiling man in a blue suit and tie with a blurred cityscape background.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68474778d698bc1407d024b2_Bryan%20Olshock.avif)\\n\\nBryan Olshock\\n\\nChief Marketing Officer\\n\\n“Jasper has the potential to fundamentally transform the way marketing teams operate by boosting efficiency, accelerating execution, and delivering high-quality campaigns faster.”\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68434c301f414a2ea030e968_a6c1b90a41e5fcf3f6116b06436efadb_Stories%20Logo%20-%20ServiceTitan.svg)\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/6822880ad0979f638d9ae2e9_trust.svg)\\n\\nTrust Foundation\\n\\n## Enterprise-grade security, quality outputs\\n\\nEnterprise-grade security and an LLM-agnostic architecture prioritize your data protection & privacy while providing superior quality marketing outputs.\\n\\n[Explore Trust](/trust)Explore Trust\\n\\nExplore Trust\\n\\nResources\\n\\n## Your AI success starts here\\n\\n[Explore All Resources](/resources)Explore All Resources\\n\\nExplore All Resources\\n\\n![Black and white grainy image of a coffee mug and an open book on a table by a window with a mountain view poster.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68adf3d8d373d954728bbf48_Jasper%20Blog.avif)\\n\\n## The Jasper Blog\\n\\nStories, insights, and best practices for AI powered marketing.\\n\\n[Learn More](/blog)Learn More\\n\\n![Black and white stippled hand holding a stepped block structure resembling a pyramid.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68adf3d8e60beed1c70d2fa6_Foundations.avif)\\n\\n## Watch Jasper Foundations\\n\\nThe foundational knowledge and skills to leverage Jasper for any type of marketing project.\\n\\n[Learn More](https://community.jasper.ai/c/jasper-foundations/)Learn More\\n\\n![Black and white artistic dotted image of a rocket launching with smoke and clouds.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68adf3d872cf04c9de6140d8_Customer%20Stories.avif)\\n\\n## Customer Stories\\n\\nHow businesses like yours are leveraging Jasper to drive growth and success.\\n\\n[Learn More](/customer-stories)Learn More\\n\\n![Black and white dot patterned illustration of two hands shaking, with purple grid and line graphic elements in the background.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68adf3d86ed7a71438c9e2e3_Get%20Support.avif)\\n\\n## Get Support\\n\\nGet in touch about your account, partnerships, press, careers, and more.\\n\\n[Learn More](/contact-support)Learn More\\n\\n![Illustration of a flock of white swans flying over stylized black and white clouds with a pixelated coral and white grid background.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68adf3d7cdf2fd1ec2a2b8a3_Community.avif)\\n\\n## Connect with community\\n\\nSelf-paced guides, courses, events, and resources, plus channels to connect with fellow marketers.\\n\\n[Learn More](https://community.jasper.ai/)Learn More\\n\\n![Abstract architectural illustration in black and white with yellow horizontal stripes in the background.](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/68adf3d8f99a1440aa062825_Knowledge%20Center.avif)\\n\\n## Search Knowledge Center\\n\\nLearn how to use generative AI for your specific marketing role and use case.\\n\\n[Learn More](https://community.jasper.ai/s/learn/)Learn More\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/682df495036085a82bc6ae35_paper-texture.webp)\\n\\n![](https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6807ee8d73c233fb82842313/682df4e3983d64a279638ad3_footer-texture.png)\\n\\n[\\n\\nPlatform\\n\\n](/platform)\\n\\n[\\n\\nAgents\\n\\n](/agents)\\n\\n-   [Optimization](/agents/optimization)\\n-   [Personalization](/agents/personalization)\\n-   [Research](/agents/research)\\n\\n[\\n\\nContent Pipelines\\n\\n](/content-pipelines)\\n\\n-   [AI Studio](/studio)\\n-   [Jasper Grid](/grid)\\n-   [Canvas](/studio)\\n    -   [Marketing AI Editor](/editor)\\n    -   [Jasper Chat](/chat)\\n-   [AI Image Suite](/image-suite)\\n-   [Jasper API](/api)\\n    -   [The Jasper MCP](/mcp)\\n\\n[\\n\\nJasper IQ\\n\\n](/jasper-iq)\\n\\n-   [Marketing IQ](/marketing-iq)\\n-   [Knowledge Base](/knowledge-base)\\n-   [Brand IQ](/brand-iq)\\n    -   [Brand Voice](/brand-voice)\\n    -   [Visual Guidelines](/visual-guidelines)\\n    -   [Style Guide](/style-guide)\\n\\n[\\n\\nSolutions\\n\\n](/solutions)\\n\\n[\\n\