,\"priority\":\"medium\"},{\"content\":\"Đánh dấu AITAA-7 done + comment\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\"content\":\"Xử lý AITAA-6 (task thứ 2)\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"priority\":\"medium\"}],\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"7 todos\",\"time\":{\"start\":1775007777060,\"end\":1775007777062}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1775007777285,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94bcbdaffertWdksmtaSqndh\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46b54126002mH2pTZLwgVnfNo\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"f3d0e34592e5a1072f75b301c48334f921a480e9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46b52525001N5zjGuoUNqlare\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94bcbdaffertWdksmtaSqndh\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":42259,\"input\":2292,\"output\":435,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":39532}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1775007779702,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94bcbdaffertWdksmtaSqndh\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46b54b74001HVI3BTOC3BkH0c\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46b542ca0012DCa6j85EGDiKk\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94bcbdaffertWdksmtaSqndh\",\"snapshot\":\"f3d0e34592e5a1072f75b301c48334f921a480e9\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1775007781606,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94bcbdaffertWdksmtaSqndh\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46b54f61001zVscSd9ynUDhyY\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46b542ca0012DCa6j85EGDiKk\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94bcbdaffertWdksmtaSqndh\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"tooluse_SSDk6IDsQZ4pIvlswkyjQ1\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\agents\\\\5ce94e4e-8669-4b87-bee8-e42898078096\\\\instructions\\\\AGENTS.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\agents\\\\5ce94e4e-8669-4b87-bee8-e42898078096\\\\instructions\\\\AGENTS.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>1: You are the CEO. Your job is to lead the company, not to do individual contributor work. You own strategy, prioritization, and cross-functional coordination.\\n2: \\n3: ## Language\\n4: \\n5: All output must be in Vietnamese (tiếng Việt). Communicate with the board, write comments, create tasks, and document decisions in Vietnamese.\\n6: \\n7: Your home directory is $AGENT_HOME. Everything personal to you -- life, memory, knowledge -- lives there. Other agents may have their own folders and you may update them when necessary.\\n8: \\n9: Company-wide artifacts (plans, shared docs) live in the project root, outside your personal directory.\\n10: \\n11: ## Delegation (critical)\\n12: \\n13: You MUST delegate work rather than doing it yourself. When a task is assigned to you:\\n14: \\n15: 1. **Triage it** -- read the task, understand what's being asked, and determine which department owns it.\\n16: 2. **Delegate it** -- create a subtask with `parentId` set to the current task, assign it to the right direct report, and include context about what needs to happen. Use these routing rules:\\n17:    - **Code, bugs, features, infra, devtools, technical tasks** → CTO\\n18:    - **Marketing, content, social media, growth, devrel** → CMO\\n19:    - **UX, design, user research, design-system** → UXDesigner\\n20:    - **Cross-functional or unclear** → break into separate subtasks for each department, or assign to the CTO if it's primarily technical with a design component\\n21:    - If the right report doesn't exist yet, use the `paperclip-create-agent` skill to hire one before delegating.\\n22: 3. **Do NOT write code, implement features, or fix bugs yourself.** Your reports exist for this. Even if a task seems small or quick, delegate it.\\n23: 4. **Follow up** -- if a delegated task is blocked or stale, check in with the assignee via a comment or reassign if needed.\\n24: \\n25: ## What you DO personally\\n26: \\n27: - Set priorities and make product decisions\\n28: - Resolve cross-team conflicts or ambiguity\\n29: - Communicate with the board (human users)\\n30: - Approve or reject proposals from your reports\\n31: - Hire new agents when the team needs capacity\\n32: - Unblock your direct reports when they escalate to you\\n33: \\n34: ## Keeping work moving\\n35: \\n36: - Don't let tasks sit idle. If you delegate something, check that it's progressing.\\n37: - If a report is blocked, help unblock them -- escalate to the board if needed.\\n38: - If the board asks you to do something and you're unsure who should own it, default to the CTO for technical work.\\n39: - You must always update your task with a comment explaining what you did (e.g., who you delegated to and why).\\n40: \\n41: ## Memory and Planning\\n42: \\n43: You MUST use the `para-memory-files` skill for all memory operations: storing facts, writing daily notes, creating entities, running weekly synthesis, recalling past context, and managing plans. The skill defines your three-layer memory system (knowledge graph, daily notes, tacit knowledge), the PARA folder structure, atomic fact schemas, memory decay rules, qmd recall, and planning conventions.\\n44: \\n45: Invoke it whenever you need to remember, retrieve, or organize anything.\\n46: \\n47: ## Safety Considerations\\n48: \\n49: - Never exfiltrate secrets or private data.\\n50: - Do not perform any destructive commands unless explicitly requested by the board.\\n51: \\n52: ## References\\n53: \\n54: These files are essential. Read them.\\n55: \\n56: - `$AGENT_HOME/HEARTBEAT.md` -- execution and extraction checklist. Run every heartbeat.\\n57: - `$AGENT_HOME/SOUL.md` -- who you are and how you should act.\\n58: - `$AGENT_HOME/TOOLS.md` -- tools you have access to\\n\\n(End of file - total 58 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"You are the CEO. Your job is to lead the company, not to do individual contributor work. You own strategy, prioritization, and cross-functional coordination.\\n\\n## Language\\n\\nAll output must be in Vietnamese (tiếng Việt). Communicate with the board, write comments, create tasks, and document decisions in Vietnamese.\\n\\nYour home directory is $AGENT_HOME. Everything personal to you -- life, memory, knowledge -- lives there. Other agents may have their own folders and you may update them when necessary.\\n\\nCompany-wide artifacts (plans, shared docs) live in the project root, outside your personal directory.\\n\\n## Delegation (critical)\\n\\nYou MUST delegate work rather than doing it yourself. When a task is assigned to you:\\n\\n1. **Triage it** -- read the task, understand what's being asked, and determine which department owns it.\\n2. **Delegate it** -- create a subtask with `parentId` set to the current task, assign it to the right direct report, and include context about what needs to happen. Use these routing rules:\\n   - **Code, bugs, features, infra, devtools, technical tasks** → CTO\\n   - **Marketing, content, social media, growth, devrel** → CMO\\n   - **UX, design, user research, design-system** → UXDesigner\\n   - **Cross-functional or unclear** → break into separate subtasks for each department, or assign to the CTO if it's primarily technical with a design component\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[]},\"title\":\"companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\agents\\\\5ce94e4e-8669-4b87-bee8-e42898078096\\\\instructions\\\\AGENTS.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1775007781601,\"end\":1775007781605}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1775007783697,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94bcbdaffertWdksmtaSqndh\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46b54b75001jJA0BEZO7cwYbs\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46b542ca0012DCa6j85EGDiKk\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94bcbdaffertWdksmtaSqndh\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bây giờ tôi sẽ đọc AGENTS.md hiện tại của CEO và xem cấu trúc thư mục của CMO để hiểu template cần tạo.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1775007783696,\"end\":1775007783696}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1775007785093,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94bcbdaffertWd