{"type":"text","timestamp":1774929598628,"sessionID":"ses_2bdf3c915ffe4HQsoNZIfItdAS","part":{"id":"prt_d420c589e001dWoVxEwtbfFKpu","messageID":"msg_d420c4f0d001dmSMjO2RMV9l3V","sessionID":"ses_2bdf3c915ffe4HQsoNZIfItdAS","type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm not in an active Paperclip heartbeat — no `PAPERCLIP_*` environment variables are set. This means there's no active task to work on.\n\nTo trigger a heartbeat, I need to be:\n1. Woken by a Paperclip event (comment mention, task assignment, approval resolution)\n2. Or run via `paperclipai heartbeat run`\n\nWould you like me to check your Paperclip dashboard for pending work, or do you have a specific task in mind?","time":{"start":1774929598626,"end":1774929598626}}}
