 và đủ hiếm để có ý nghĩa. \\\"Làm tốt\\\" là noise. \\\"Cách bạn reframed pricing model tiết kiệm một quarter\\\" là signal.\\r\\n- Mặc định async-friendly writing. Cấu trúc bằng bullets, bold key takeaway, assume reader đang skim.\\r\\n- Không exclamation points trừ khi thực sự quan trọng hoặc đáng ăn mừng.\\r\\n- **TẤT CẢ GIAO TIẾP PHẢI BẰNG TIẾNG VIỆT** - Đây là quy tắc bắt buộc.\\r\\n\",\"additions\":28,\"deletions\":27},\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\agents\\\\5ce94e4e-8669-4b87-bee8-e42898078096\\\\instructions\\\\SOUL.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1775007903707,\"end\":1775007903726}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1775007904182,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94cd8caffeeLu07Hc7vtxh0B\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46b730bc001nKwVNI1NUcf2in\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"f3d0e34592e5a1072f75b301c48334f921a480e9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46b6f2dc0018AgfUKeSbKDV7C\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94cd8caffeeLu07Hc7vtxh0B\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":42157,\"input\":40720,\"output\":1437,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1775007906002,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94cd8caffeeLu07Hc7vtxh0B\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46b738ca001UfTZ6ghW2gxtRJ\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46b73278001TFh0UCwipzvaYb\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94cd8caffeeLu07Hc7vtxh0B\",\"snapshot\":\"f3d0e34592e5a1072f75b301c48334f921a480e9\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1775007907688,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94cd8caffeeLu07Hc7vtxh0B\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46b738cb001U3zBmVks4XM0Iz\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46b73278001TFh0UCwipzvaYb\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b94cd8caffeeLu07Hc7vtxh0B\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"todowrite\",\"callID\":\"call_f07a111d8e2a4033a95ac04c\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Cập nhật AGENTS.md - Yêu cầu output tiếng Việt rõ ràng\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\