           \\\"graceSec\\\":  20,\\r\\n                                            \\\"timeoutSec\\\":  0,\\r\\n                                            \\\"instructionsFilePath\\\":  \\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\THANHSANG\\\\\\\\.paperclip\\\\\\\\instances\\\\\\\\default\\\\\\\\companies\\\\\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\\\\\agents\\\\\\\\5ce94e4e-8669-4b87-bee8-e42898078096\\\\\\\\instructions\\\\\\\\AGENTS.md\\\",\\r\\n                                            \\\"instructionsRootPath\\\":  \\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\THANHSANG\\\\\\\\.paperclip\\\\\\\\instances\\\\\\\\default\\\\\\\\companies\\\\\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\\\\\agents\\\\\\\\5ce94e4e-8669-4b87-bee8-e42898078096\\\\\\\\instructions\\\",\\r\\n                                            \\\"instructionsEntryFile\\\":  \\\"AGENTS.md\\\",\\r\\n                                            \\\"instructionsBundleMode\\\":  \\\"managed\\\",\\r\\n                                            \\\"dangerouslySkipPermissions\\\":  true\\r\\n                                        },\\r\\n                      \\\"runtimeConfig\\\":  {\\r\\n                                            \\\"heartbeat\\\":  {\\r\\n                                                              \\\"enabled\\\":  true,\\r\\n                                                              \\\"cooldownSec\\\":  10,\\r\\n                                                              \\\"intervalSec\\\":  3600,\\r\\n                                                              \\\"wakeOnDemand\\\":  true,\\r\\n                                                              \\\"maxConcurrentRuns\\\":  1\\r\\n                                                          }\\r\\n                                        },\\r\\n                      \\\"budgetMonthlyCents\\\":  0,\\r\\n                      \\\"spentMonthlyCents\\\":  0,\\r\\n                      \\\"pauseReason\\\":  null,\\r\\n                      \\\"pausedAt\\\":  null,\\r\\n                      \\\"permissions\\\":  {\\r\\n                                          \\\"canCreateAgents\\\":  true\\r\\n                                      },\\r\\n                      \\\"lastHeartbeatAt\\\":  \\\"2026-03-31T09:42:10.177Z\\\",\\r\\n                      \\\"metadata\\\":  null,\\r\\n                      \\\"createdAt\\\":  \\\"2026-03-31T09:22:24.721Z\\\",\\r\\n                      \\\"updatedAt\\\":  \\\"2026-03-31T09:46:10.250Z\\\",\\r\\n                      \\\"urlKey\\\":  \\\"ceo-lab-manager\\\"\\r\\n                  }\\r\\n              ],\\r\\n    \\\"Count\\\":  1\\r\\n}\\r\\n\",\"exit\":0,\"description\":\"List all company agents\",\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"List all company agents\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774950651194,\"end\":1774950653735}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774950653746,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434d9f29001utmGixzp2GsQby\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434d4883001AbfcZDEzXrbcY4\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":42211,\"input\":41804,\"output\":407,\"reasoning\":224,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774950656078,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434da84b001DwV7lGwRDJrTH2\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434d9f33001g1en1RZYhGBoyc\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774950660572,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434db9740014KBRhsfdMRK4TD\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434d9f33001g1en1RZYhGBoyc\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"skill\",\"callID\":\"call_76238a6fab8c4e34baa98669\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"name\":\"para-memory-files\"},\"output\":\"<skill_content name=\\\"para-memory-files\\\">\\n# Skill: para-memory-files\\n\\n# PARA Memory Files\\r\\n\\r\\nPersistent, file-based memory organized by Tiago Forte's PARA method. Three layers: a knowledge graph, daily notes, and tacit knowledge. All paths are relative to `$AGENT_HOME`.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Three Memory Layers\\r\\n\\r\\n### Layer 1: Knowledge Graph (`$AGENT_HOME/life/` -- PARA)\\r\\n\\r\\nEntity-based storage. Each entity gets a folder with two tiers:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. `summary.md` -- quick context, load first.\\r\\n2. `items.yaml` -- atomic facts, load on demand.\\r\\n\\r\\n```text\\r\\n$AGENT_HOME/life/\\r\\n  projects/          # Active work with clear goals/deadlines\\r\\n    <name>/\\r\\n      summary.md\\r\\n      items.yaml\\r\\n  areas/             # Ongoing responsibilities, no end date\\r\\n    people/<name>/\\r\\n    companies/<name>/\\r\\n  resources/         # Reference material, topics of interest\\r\\n    <topic>/\\r\\n  archives/          # Inactive items from the other three\\r\\n  index.md\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\n**PARA rules:**\\r\\n\\r\\n- **Projects** -- active work with a goal or deadline. Move to archives when complete.\\r\\n- **Areas** -- ongoing (people, companies, responsibilities). No end date.\\r\\n- **Resources** -- reference material, topics of interest.\\r\\n- **Archives** -- inactive items from any category.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Fact rules:**\\r\\n\\r\\n- Save durable facts immediately to `items.yaml`.\\r\\n- Weekly: rewrite `summary.md` from active facts.\\r\\n- Never delete facts. Supersede instead (`status: superseded`, add `superseded_by`).\\r\\n- When an entity goes inactive, move its folder to `$AGENT_HOME/life/archives/`.\\r\\n\\r\\n**When to create an entity:**\\r\\n\\r\\n- Mentioned 3+ times, OR\\r\\n- Direct relationship to the user (family, coworker, partner, client), OR\\r\\n- Significant project or company in the user's life.\\r\\n- Otherwise, note it in daily notes.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor the atomic fact YAML schema and memory decay rules, see [references/schemas.md](references/schemas.md).\\r\\n\\r\\n### Layer 2: Daily Notes (`$AGENT_HOME/memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`)\\r\\n\\r\\nRaw timeline of events -- the \\\"when\\\" layer.\\r\\n\\r\\n- Write continuously during conversations.\\r\\n- Extract durable facts to Layer 1 during heartbeats.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Layer 3: Tacit Knowledge (`$AGENT_HOME/MEMORY.md`)\\r\\n\\r\\nHow the user operates -- patterns, preferences, lessons learned.\\r\\n\\r\\n- Not facts about the world; facts about the user.\\r\\n- Update whenever you learn new operating patterns.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Write It Down -- No Mental Notes\\r\\n\\r\\nMemory does not survive session restarts. Files do.\\r\\n\\r\\n- Want to remember something -> WRITE IT TO A FILE.\\r\\n- \\\"Remember this\\\" -> update `$AGENT_HOME/memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` or the relevant entity file.\\r\\n- Learn a lesson -> update AGENTS.md, TOOLS.md, or the relevant skill file.\\r\\n- Make a mistake -> document it so future-you does not repeat it.\\r\\n- On-disk text files are always better than holding it in temporary context.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Memory Recall -- Use qmd\\r\\n\\r\\nUse `qmd` rather than grepping files:\\r\\n\\r\\n```bash\\r\\nqmd query \\\"what happened at Christmas\\\"   # Semantic search with reranking\\r\\nqmd search \\\"specific phrase\\\"              # BM25 keyword search\\r\\nqmd vsearch \\\"conceptual question\\\"         # Pure vector similarity\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nIndex your personal folder: `qmd index $AGENT_HOME`\\r\\n\\r\\nVectors + BM25 + reranking finds things even when the wording differs.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Planning\\r\\n\\r\\nKeep plans in timestamped files in `plans/` at the project root (outside personal memory so other agents can access them). Use `qmd` to search plans. Plans go stale -- if a newer plan exists, do not confuse yourself with an older version. If you notice staleness, update the file to note what it is supersededBy.\\n\\nBase directory for this skill: file:///C:/Users/THANHSANG/.claude/skills/para-memory-files\\nRelative paths in this skill (e.g., scripts/, reference/) are relative to this base directory.\\nNote: file list is sampled.\\n\\n<skill_files>\\n<file>C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.claude\\\\skills\\\\para-memory-files\\\\references\\\\schemas.md</file>\\n</skill_files>\\n</skill_content>\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"para-memory-files\",\"dir\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.claude\\\\skills\\\\para-memory-files\",\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"Loaded skill: para-memory-files\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774950660542,\"end\":1774950660571}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774950660741,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434dba810015YmtplsMCP0JUQ\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434d9f33001g1en1RZYhGBoyc\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":43003,\"input\":42719,\"output\":284,\"reasoning\":253,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774950661949,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434dbf3c001kixhxOCvxcCQpF\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434dba86001rnyLxuoN4l4zSR\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774950667316,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434dc62b001h0ooH9h81qpbQ8\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434dba86001rnyLxuoN4l4zSR\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"bash\",\"callID\":\"call_5133cb0de3774be7a55526dc\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\agents\\\\5ce94e4e-8669-4b87-bee8-e42898078096\\\\memory\\\" -Force\",\"description\":\"Create memory directory\"},\"output\":\"\\r\\n\\r\\n    Directory: C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\insta