29670,\"end\":1774950729670}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774950730911,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434ec084001PA6AhMiTHZT3CC\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434eb145001HFL8qi4d9CU4zM\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"bash\",\"callID\":\"call_86344dbca53a44b09c892006\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\plans\\\" -Force\",\"description\":\"Create shared plans directory\"},\"output\":\"\\r\\n\\r\\n    Directory: C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nMode                 LastWriteTime         Length Name                                                                 \\r\\n----                 -------------         ------ ----                                                                 \\r\\nd-----        31/03/2026   4:52 PM                plans                                                                \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"metadata\":{\"output\":\"\\r\\n\\r\\n    Directory: C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nMode                 LastWriteTime         Length Name                                                                 \\r\\n----                 -------------         ------ ----                                                                 \\r\\nd-----        31/03/2026   4:52 PM                plans                                                                \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"exit\":0,\"description\":\"Create shared plans directory\",\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"Create shared plans directory\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774950729488,\"end\":1774950730905}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774950730911,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434ecc9a001LnfNL1ivDxJcnt\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434eb145001HFL8qi4d9CU4zM\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":50345,\"input\":50128,\"output\":217,\"reasoning\":80,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774950732232,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434ed1c3001yifOCjo5Lg2RKe\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434ecc9f001ydirGf8L9ojOtU\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774950781398,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d434ed5d7001cgD9SUJwDNbwH3\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d434ecc9f001ydirGf8L9ojOtU\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bcb65f93ffehLTYo97YiaKMKy\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"write\",\"callID\":\"call_e7cbda26d6044468854bc47c\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"content\":\"# Content Operations Plan — AI Thuc Dong Lab\\n# Created: 2026-03-31\\n# Owner: CEO\\n# Supersedes: None\\n# Status: Active\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Company Mission\\n\\nBuild personal brand \\\"AI Thuc Dong Lab\\\" — leading niche of AI Productivity & Automation in Vietnam.\\n\\n**Targets (6 months):**\\n- 50,000 followers across all channels\\n- $2,000/month revenue from SaaS Affiliate\\n- Simplify AI knowledge for mass audience\\n\\n**Content Philosophy:**\\n- Vietnamese language, natural tone\\n- Simple enough for grade 7 students to understand\\n- Focus on AI productivity tools\\n- Actionable, not theoretical\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1-Month Content Calendar (Month 1: April 2026)\\n\\n### Content Pillars\\n\\n| Pillar | Weight | Description |\\n|--------|--------|-------------|\\n| Tool Reviews | 30% | Deep-dive AI tools, pros/cons, pricing |\\n| How-To Guides | 25% | Step-by-step tutorials, automation recipes |\\n| Trend Analysis | 15% | AI news breakdown, what it means for Vietnamese users |\\n| Productivity Tips | 15% | Quick wins, workflow hacks |\\n| Personal/Behind-the-Scenes | 10% | Journey, lessons, community Q&A |\\n| Affiliate Promos | 5% | Soft-sell tool recommendations with affiliate links |\\n\\n### Weekly Rhythm\\n\\n| Day | Content Type | Channels |\\n|-----|-------------|----------|\\n| Monday | Tool Review (long-form) | YouTube, LinkedIn, Facebook |\\n| Tuesday | How-To Guide (tutorial) | YouTube, TikTok, Facebook |\\n| Wednesday | Trend Analysis (commentary) | LinkedIn, Threads, Facebook |\\n| Thursday | Productivity Tip (quick) | TikTok, Threads, LinkedIn |\\n| Friday | How-To Guide (tutorial) | YouTube, TikTok, Facebook |\\n| Saturday | Personal/BTS (casual) | Threads, Facebook, TikTok |\\n| Sunday | Weekly roundup / Q&A | LinkedIn, Facebook, Threads |\\n\\n### Month 1 Content Schedule (28 pieces)\\n\\n#### Week 1 (Mar 31 - Apr 6): Foundation — \\\"AI Basics Everyone Should Know\\\"\\n\\n| # | Title | Pillar | Channels | Format |\\n|---|-------|--------|----------|--------|\\n| 1 | \\\"5 AI Tools Free Students Need in 2026\\\" | Tool Review | YT, LI, FB | Video 8-10min + post |\\n| 2 | \\\"How to Use ChatGPT to Write Essays (Step-by-Step)\\\" | How-To | YT, TT, FB | Video 5-7min + shorts |\\n| 3 | \\\"Google Gemini vs ChatGPT: Which is Better for Vietnamese?\\\" | Trend | LI, Threads, FB | Text post + thread |\\n| 4 | \\\"3 AI Prompts That Save 2 Hours Daily\\\" | Productivity | TT, Threads, LI | Short video + carousel |\\n| 5 | \\\"How to Automate Email Responses with AI\\\" | How-To | YT, TT, FB | Video 6-8min |\\n| 6 | \\\"Why I Started AI Thuc Dong Lab\\\" | Personal | Threads, FB, TT | Text + short video |\\n| 7 | \\\"Week 1 Recap: Best AI Tools We Tested\\\" | Roundup | LI, FB, Threads | Summary post |\\n\\n#### Week 2 (Apr 7-13): \\\"AI for Work & Study\\\"\\n\\n| # | Title | Pillar | Channels | Format |\\n|---|-------|--------|----------|--------|\\n| 8 | \\\"Notion AI Full Review: Worth the Money?\\\" | Tool Review | YT, LI, FB | Video 10-12min |\\n| 9 | \\\"How to Create Presentations with AI in 5 Minutes\\\" | How-To | YT, TT, FB | Video 5-7min |\\n| 10 | \\\"OpenAI o3 Released — What It Means for You\\\" | Trend | LI, Threads, FB | Analysis post |\\n| 11 | \\\"The 1-Minute Rule: AI + Time Management\\\" | Productivity | TT, Threads, LI | Short video + tip |\\n| 12 | \\\"How to Build a Personal Knowledge Base with AI\\\" | How-To | YT, TT, FB | Video 8-10min |\\n| 13 | \\\"My Biggest Mistake Learning AI (So You Don't)\\\" | Personal | Threads, FB, TT | Story post |\\n| 14 | \\\"Week 2 Recap: AI Tools That Actually Work\\\" | Roundup | LI, FB, Threads | Summary post |\\n\\n#### Week 3 (Apr 14-20): \\\"Automation for Everyone\\\"\\n\\n| # | Title | Pillar | Channels | Format |\\n|---|-------|--------|----------|--------|\\n| 15 | \\\"Zapier vs Make.com: Best Automation Tool 2026\\\" | Tool Review | YT, LI, FB | Video 10-12min |\\n| 16 | \\\"How to Auto-Summarize YouTube Videos with AI\\\" | How-To | YT, TT, FB | Video 5-7min |\\n| 17 | \\\"AI Agents Are Here — Should You Care?\\\" | Trend | LI, Threads, FB | Opinion piece |\\n| 18 | \\\"5 Chrome Extensions That Make You 10x Faster\\\" | Productivity | TT, Threads, LI | Short video + list |\\n| 19 | \\\"How to Create AI Chatbots for Your Business\\\" | How-To | YT, TT, FB | Video 8-10min |\\n| 20 | \\\"What I Learned from 100 AI Tool Tests\\\" | Personal | Threads, FB, TT | Lessons post |\\n| 21 | \\\"Week 3 Recap: Automation Wins\\\" | Roundup | LI, FB, Threads | Summary post |\\n\\n#### Week 4 (Apr 21-28): \\\"AI Money — Affiliate & Side Hustles\\\"\\n\\n| # | Title | Pillar | Channels | Format |\\n|---|-------|--------|----------|--------|\\n| 22 | \\\"Top 5 AI Affiliate Programs That Actually Pay\\\" | Tool Review | YT, LI, FB | Video 10-12min + affiliate |\\n| 23 | \\\"How I Made My First $100 with AI Affiliate\\\" | How-To | YT, TT, FB | Video 8-10min |\\n| 24 | \\\"Jasper AI vs Copy.ai: Best for Vietnamese Content?\\\" | Trend | LI, Threads, FB | Comparison post |\\n| 25 | \\\"The $0 AI Stack: Free Tools That Replace Paid Ones\\\" | Productivity | TT, Threads, LI | Short video + list |\\n| 26 | \\\"How to Start an AI YouTube Channel (Full Guide)\\\" | How-To | YT, TT, FB | Video 10-12min |\\n| 27 | \\\"Month 1 Results: What Worked, What Didn't\\\" | Personal | Threads, FB, TT | Transparency post |\\n| 28 | \\\"Month 1 Recap + Month 2 Preview\\\" | Roundup | LI, FB, Threads | Summary post |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Channel Strategy\\n\\n### LinkedIn\\n- **Frequency:** 4 posts/week (Mon, Wed, Thu, Sun)\\n- **Format:** Long-form text posts, carousels, article links\\n- **Tone:** Professional, analytical, thought leadership\\n- **Goal:** Build authority, attract B2B audience\\n\\n### Threads\\n- **Frequency:** 5 posts/week (Wed, Thu, Sat, Sun + daily replies)\\n- **Format:** Short text threads, quick tips, engagement\\n- **Tone:** Conversational, authentic, slightly casual\\n- **Goal:** Community building, viral reach\\n\\n### TikTok\\n- **Frequency:** 4 videos/week (Tue, Thu, Fri, Sat)\\n- **Format:** 30-60sec vertical videos, screen recordings\\n- **Tone:** Energetic, visual, hook-driven\\n- **Goal:** Mass reach, younger audience, brand awareness\\n\\n### YouTube\\n- **Frequency:** 3 videos/week (Mon, Tue/Fri alternating, 1 long-form)\\n- **Format:** 5-12min tutorials, reviews, deep-dives\\n- **Tone:** Educational, structured, value-first\\n- **Goal:** Evergreen content, SEO, affiliate revenue\\n\\n### Facebook\\n- **Frequency:** 5 posts/week (Mon, Tue, Wed, Fri, Sun)\\n- **Format:** Video posts, image posts, group engagement\\n- **Tone:** Friendly, community-oriented, Vietnamese-first\\n- **Goal:** Local audience, community building, sharing\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Hiring Plan\\n\\n### Phase 1: Immediate (Week 1-2) — CMO ✅ Submitted for Approval\\n\\n**CMO — Chief Marketing Officer**\\n- **Role:** Own content strategy, channel management, brand voice\\n- **Responsibilities:**\\n  - Execute content calendar\\n  - Manage all 5 channels\\n  - Maintain brand voice consistency\\n  - Report weekly metrics to CEO\\n- **Reports to:** CEO\\n\\n### Phase 2: Month 1 (Week 2-4) — Core Team\\n\\n**Market Researcher**\\n- **Role:** SaaS & AI trend research\\n- **Responsibilities:**\\n  - Weekly AI tool landscape scan\\n  - Competitor content analysis\\n  - Affiliate program discovery & evaluation\\n  - Trend reports for content team\\n- **Reports to:** CMO\\n\\n**Omnichannel Writer**\\n- **Role:** Content creation across all platforms\\n- **Responsibilities:**\\n  - Write LinkedIn posts, Threads, Facebook posts\\n  - Script YouTube videos and TikToks\\n  - Adapt one piece of content into 5 formats\\n  - Maintain Vietnamese natural tone\\n- **Reports to:** CMO\\n\\n### Phase 3: Month 2 — Growth & Quality\\n\\n**QA & Affiliate Manager**\\n- **Role:** Quality control + affiliate revenue optimization\\n- **Responsibilities:**\\n  - Review all content before publishing\\n  - Manage affiliate link placement and tracking\\n  - A/B test content formats\\n  - Revenue reporting and optimization\\n- **Reports to:** CMO\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Task Breakdown (Ready for Delegation)\\n\\n### Content Production Tasks (for CMO team)\\n\\n| Task ID | Title | Assignee | Priority | Description |\\n|---------|-------|----------|----------|-------------|\\n| C-001 | Set up content calendar system | CMO | High | Create tracking system for 28 pieces across 5 channels |\\n| C-002 | Produce Week 1 content (7 pieces) | CMO + Writer | Critical | Execute Week 1 content plan |\\n| C-003 | Produce Week 2 content (7 pieces) | CMO + Writer | High | Execute Week 2 content plan |\\n| C-004 | Produce Week 3 content (7 pieces) | CMO + Writer | High | Execute Week 3 content plan |\\n| C-005 | Produce Week 4 content (7 pieces) | CMO + Writer | High | Execute Week 4 content plan |\\n| C-006 | Set up affiliate accounts | CMO + QA | Medium | Register for top 5 affiliate programs |\\n| C-007 | Weekly metrics report | CMO | Medium | Track followers, engagement, revenue |\\n\\n### Research Tasks (for Market Researcher)\\n\\n| Task ID | Title | Assignee | Priority | Description |\\n|---------|-------|----------|----------|-------------|\\n| R-001 | AI tool landscape scan | Researcher | High | Weekly report on new AI tools |\\n| R-002 | Competitor content analysis | Researcher | Medium | Analyze top 10 VN AI content creators |\\n| R-003 | Affiliate program evaluation | Researcher | High | Find and rank best-paying AI affiliate programs |\\n\\n### Quality Tasks (for QA Manager)\\n\\n| Task ID | Title | Assignee | Priority | Description |\\n|---------|-------|----------|----------|-------------|\\n| Q-001 | Content review checklist | QA | High | Create QA checklist for all content |\\n| Q-002 | Affiliate link tracking setup | QA | Medium | Implement tracking for all affiliate links |\\n| Q-003 | Monthly quality audit | QA | Low | Review all published content for quality |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Success Metrics (Month 1)\\n\\n| Metric | Target | Measurement |\\n|--------|--------|-------------|\\n| Total Followers | 2,000 | Sum across all 5 channels |\\n| Content Pieces Published | 28 | Per calendar |\\n| Engagement Rate | 5%+ | Likes + comments / followers |\\n| Affiliate Revenue | $50 | First month, baseline |\\n| YouTube Views | 5,000 | Total across all videos |\\n| LinkedIn Impressions | 20,000 | Total post impressions |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- All content in Vietnamese\\n- Grade 7 readability target\\n- No jargon without explanation\\n- Affiliate links should feel natural, not salesy\\n- Consistency > perfection in Month 1\\n\",\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\plans\\\\content-operations-plan-2026-04.md\"},\"output\":\"Wrote file successfully.\",\"metadata\":{\"diagnostics\":{},\"filepath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\T