(https://www.youtube.com/OpenAI)[(opens in a new window)](https://www.linkedin.com/company/openai)[(opens in a new window)](https://github.com/openai)[(opens in a new window)](https://www.instagram.com/openai/)[(opens in a new window)](https://www.tiktok.com/@openai)[(opens in a new window)](https://discord.gg/openai)\\n\\nOpenAI © 2015–2026Manage Cookies\\n\\nEnglishUnited States\",\"metadata\":{\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"https://openai.com/blog (text/html; charset=utf-8)\",\"time\":{\"start\":1775010115261,\"end\":1775010116215}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1775010116400,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46d8f2780013ckHiGkXLbbJJi\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"f3d0e34592e5a1072f75b301c48334f921a480e9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46d8df4b0017005AAKgJML1qP\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":60265,\"input\":779,\"output\":177,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":59309}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1775010119170,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46d8fe00001MRCoCFvN94UaPv\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46d8f3e5001Ytwt2S9FuksLm0\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"snapshot\":\"f3d0e34592e5a1072f75b301c48334f921a480e9\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1775010121052,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46d8fe01001D6WXn0r7nqN9rH\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46d8f3e5001Ytwt2S9FuksLm0\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tốt! Tôi thấy OpenAI đã có **GPT-5** và thậm chí **GPT-5.3**. Đây là thông tin thực tế rất mới. Lấy thêm chi tiết về GPT-5:\",\"time\":{\"start\":1775010121051,\"end\":1775010121051}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1775010121662,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46d9033b001gcaAifY3BT1Ik0\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46d8f3e5001Ytwt2S9FuksLm0\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"webfetch\",\"callID\":\"tooluse_Ysi07NyT4YfIeao5mqy0PC\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"format\":\"markdown\",\"timeout\":30,\"url\":\"https://openai.com/gpt-5/\"},\"output\":\"GPT-5 is here | OpenAI\\n\\n[Skip to main content](#main)\\n\\n[](/)\\n\\n-   [Research](/research/index/)\\n-   Products\\n-   [Business](/business/)\\n-   [Developers](/api/)\\n-   [Company](/about/)\\n-   [Foundation(opens in a new window)](https://openaifoundation.org)\\n\\n[Try ChatGPT(opens in a new window)](https://chatgpt.com/)\\n\\n-   Research\\n-   Products\\n-   Business\\n-   Developers\\n-   Company\\n-   [Foundation(opens in a new window)](https://openaifoundation.org)\\n\\n[Try ChatGPT(opens in a new window)](https://chatgpt.com/)\\n\\nOpenAI\\n\\n## OpenAI Summer Update\\n\\n# GPT‑5 is here\\n\\nOur smartest, fastest, and most useful model yet, with thinking built in. Available to everyone.\\n\\n[Try it in ChatGPT(opens in a new window)](https://chatgpt.com)[Read the research](/index/introducing-gpt-5/)\\n\\n[ChatGPT](#chatgpt)[For developers](#for-developers)[For business](#for-businesses)\\n\\nChatGPT powered by GPT-5\\n\\n## Expert intelligence for everyone\\n\\nGPT‑5 is smarter across the board, providing more useful responses across math, science, finance, law, and more. It's like having a team of experts on call for whatever you want to know.\\n\\n#### See how people are using GPT-5\\n\\n#### More new features in ChatGPT\\n\\n![Icon representing customization](https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/4BRX77zabONkyN6QB2IBbm/d51f91c0f4cfc728fb50975d0f1bc3b9/customization_icon.svg?w=3840&q=90)\\n\\n#### Make it your own\\n\\n![Icon representing voice](https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/4mPGzTM0G36WQBMSIAWhbN/0fa676e94864c612c2fe86cf766c02dc/voice_icon.svg?w=3840&q=90)\\n\\n#### Voice improvements\\n\\n![Icon representing a book](https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/4jAoVAsq3LjWYdfCqMD0UZ/dac0554d12d5e333f0eb31182c5ce8d4/reading-level_icon.svg?w=3840&q=90)\\n\\n#### Study mode\\n\\n![Icon representing connectors](https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/4de7wGwnTHeWziK2o8KSQB/e7b75dae83ee68184fa81ca752fc6cd8/connected-apps.svg?w=3840&q=90)\\n\\n#### Connect your Gmail and Google Calendar\\n\\nFor more details, [see here⁠(opens in a new window)](https://help.openai.com/en/articles/6825453-chatgpt-release-notes)\\n\\n### The path to GPT-5\\n\\nExplore the evolution of our models in ChatGPT\\n\\n[Learn more(opens in a new window)](https://progress.openai.com)\\n\\n![gpt-progress-preview-stylized](https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/6ONA2S0a5NBShkm5cre6Zp/ac461294354d5904e8f244da97171d7c/L-progress-module.png?w=3840&q=90&fm=webp)\\n\\nFor developers\\n\\n## Our most advanced model for coding and agentic tasks\\n\\nGPT‑5 produces high-quality code, generates front-end UI with minimal prompting, and shows improvements to personality, steerability, and executing long chains of tool calls. GPT‑5 also introduces ‘minimal’ reasoning and a ‘verbosity’ parameter in the API.\\n\\n[Start building(opens in a new window)](https://platform.openai.com/)[Read the API Platform blog](/index/introducing-gpt-5-for-developers/)\\n\\n[![](https://cdn.openai.com/ctf-cdn/gpt-5-api-small.png?w=3840&q=50&fm=webp)\\n\\n### GPT-5\\n\\n-   Text & vision\\n-   400K context length | 128K max output tokens\\n-   Input $1.25 | Output $10.00 per 1M tokens\\n\\nLearn more(opens in a new window)\\n\\n(opens in a new window)](https://platform.openai.com/docs/models/gpt-5)[![](https://cdn.openai.com/ctf-cdn/gpt-5-api-small.png?w=3840&q=50&fm=webp)\\n\\n### GPT-5 mini\\n\\n-   Text & vision\\n-   400K context length | 128K max output tokens\\n-   Input $0.25 | Output $2.00 per 1M tokens\\n\\nLearn more(opens in a new window)\\n\\n(opens in a new window)](https://platform.openai.com/docs/models/gpt-5-mini)[![](https://cdn.openai.com/ctf-cdn/gpt-5-api-small.png?w=3840&q=50&fm=webp)\\n\\n### GPT-5 nano\\n\\n-   Text & vision\\n-   400K context length | 128K max output tokens\\n-   Input $0.05 | Output $0.40 per 1M tokens\\n\\nLearn more(opens in a new window)\\n\\n(opens in a new window)](https://platform.openai.com/docs/models/gpt-5-nano)\\n\\n#### See what businesses and developers have to say about GPT-5\\n\\nFor business\\n\\n## Our best model for work\\n\\nGPT‑5 is smarter, more reliable, and built for the tasks businesses depend on. Your teams can trust it to handle important work with higher confidence.\\n\\n[Try now(opens in a new window)](https://chatgpt.com/team-sign-up)[Contact sales](/contact-sales/)\\n\\n![GPT-5 analyzing to be more thoughtful](https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/4ALfxVdPzE2np77Brw0IcR/051c927eeaf0f776aa8173d8adb2e9ec/Business_1.png?w=3840&q=90&fm=webp)\\n\\nA trusted subject-matter expert\\n\\nGPT‑5 excels at writing, research, analysis, coding, and problem-solving. It delivers more accurate, professional responses and feels like collaborating with a smart, thoughtful colleague.\\n\\n[Learn how to make the most of GPT-5(opens in a new window)](https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/inside-gpt-5-for-work.pdf)\\n\\n![GPT-5 asking for follow-up input](https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/56zhFebELMHySA0sKoOUTc/9196ce690a991bf174254711d07a74ff/Business_2__1_.png?w=3840&q=90&fm=webp)\\n\\nEveryone can be a power user\\n\\nChatGPT thinks harder on complex tasks and asks relevant follow-up questions to keep work moving. Every employee can get expert-level results without switching models.\\n\\n[See how businesses use GPT-5](/index/gpt-5-new-era-of-work/)\\n\\n![GPT-5 works with connectors](https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/0U2iwmG6O98BdDgDrmszL/43f88029317e35f81b1c0b6e66f66270/Business_3.png?w=3840&q=90&fm=webp)\\n\\nSmarter with your company context\\n\\nGPT‑5 produces higher-quality responses by using your company’s files and connected apps like Google Drive, SharePoint, and more, while respecting existing permissions.\\n\\n[Explore apps(opens in a new window)](https://chatgpt.com/features/apps/)\\n\\n## Get started with GPT‑5\\n\\n[Try now(opens in a new window)](https://chatgpt.com/)\\n\\nOur Research\\n\\n-   [Research Index](/research/index/)\\n-   [Research Overview](/research/)\\n-   [Research Residency](/residency/)\\n-   [OpenAI for Science](/science/)\\n-   [Economic Research](/signals/)\\n\\nLatest Advancements\\n\\n-   [GPT-5.3 Instant](/index/gpt-5-3-instant/)\\n-   [GPT-5.3-Codex](/index/introducing-gpt-5-3-codex/)\\n-   [GPT-5](/gpt-5/)\\n-   [Codex](/index/introducing-gpt-5-3-codex/)\\n\\nSafety\\n\\n-   [Safety Approach](/safety/)\\n-   [Security & Privacy](/security-and-privacy/)\\n-   [Trust & Transparency](/trust-and-transparency/)\\n\\nChatGPT\\n\\n-   [Explore ChatGPT(opens in a new window)](https://chatgpt.com/overview)\\n-   [Business](https://chatgpt.com/business/business-plan)\\n-   [Enterprise](https://chatgpt.com/business/enterprise)\\n-   [Education](https://chatgpt.com/business/education)\\n-   [Pricing(opens in a new window)](https://chatgpt.com/pricing)\\n-   [Download(opens in a new window)](https://chatgpt.com/download)\\n\\nSora\\n\\n-   [Sora Overview](/sora/)\\n-   [Features](/sora/#features)\\n-   [Pricing](/sora/#pricing)\\n-   [Sora log in(opens in a new window)](https://sora.com/)\\n\\nAPI Platform\\n\\n-   [Platform Overview](/api/)\\n-   [Pricing](/api/pricing/)\\n-   [API log in(opens in a new window)](https://platform.openai.com/login)\\n-   [Documentation(opens in a new window)](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs)\\n-   [Developer Forum(opens in a new window)](https://community.openai.com/)\\n\\nFor Business\\n\\n-   [Business Overview](/business/)\\n-   [Solutions](/solutions/)\\n-   [Contact Sales](/contact-sales/)\\n\\nCompany\\n\\n-   [About Us](/about/)\\n-   [Our Charter](/charter/)\\n-   [Foundation(opens in a new window)](https://openaifoundation.org)\\n-   [Careers](/careers/)\\n-   [Brand](/brand/)\\n\\nSupport\\n\\n-   [Help Center(opens in a new window)](https://help.openai.com/)\\n\\nMore\\n\\n-   [News](/news/)\\n-   [Stories](/stories/)\\n-   [Livestreams](/live/)\\n-   [Podcast](/podcast/)\\n-   [RSS](https://openai.com/news/rss.xml)\\n\\nTerms & Policies\\n\\n-   [Terms of Use](/policies/terms-of-use/)\\n-   [Privacy Policy](/policies/privacy-policy/)\\n-   [Other Policies](/policies/)\\n\\n[(opens in a new window)](https://x.com/OpenAI)[(opens in a new window)](https://www.youtube.com/OpenAI)[(opens in a new window)](https://www.linkedin.com/company/openai)[(opens in a new window)](https://github.com/openai)[(opens in a new window)](https://www.instagram.com/openai/)[(opens in a new window)](https://www.tiktok.com/@openai)[(opens in a new window)](https://discord.gg/openai)\\n\\nOpenAI © 2015–2026Manage Cookies\\n\\nEnglishUnited States\",\"metadata\":{\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"https://openai.com/gpt-5/ (text/html; charset=utf-8)\",\"time\":{\"start\":1775010121050,\"end\":1775010121660}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1775010121836,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46d907bd001g5KYtccJLOGdRN\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"f3d0e34592e5a1072f75b301c48334f921a480e9\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46d8f3e5001Ytwt2S9FuksLm0\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":62855,\"input\":2598,\"output\":170,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":60087}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1775010124773,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d46d913e10019zqtT7y8KC920r\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d46d9091a001z7K4r7R50t52JW\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q\",\"snapshot\":\"f3d0e34592e5a1072f75b301c48334f921a480e9\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1775010128822,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2b928b16affe7xRIzcmE3Ezu3q