:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.config\\\\opencode\\\\docs\\\\agents\\\\CHANGELOG.md\\nC:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.config\\\\opencode\\\\docs\\\\agents\\\\README.md\",\"metadata\":{\"count\":12,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\.config\\\\opencode\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774953871143,\"end\":1774953871147}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774953872484,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d437eb7310018rAbezUPrOriuo\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"1e778bb0f71da09ca6129300b75af9f3488ca11b\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d437e9603001qptBlHE94zATqy\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":51043,\"input\":1465,\"output\":554,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":49024}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774953879467,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d437ed797001NVWKx6AZ46JrT6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d437ebff5001qUa4Xl2zobqZs6\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"snapshot\":\"1e778bb0f71da09ca6129300b75af9f3488ca11b\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774953879468,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d437ed7a5001T9MZ1Uua1WkWNr\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d437ebff5001qUa4Xl2zobqZs6\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_function_speovjaz3h7l_1\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.config\\\\opencode\\\\agents\\\\analyze.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.config\\\\opencode\\\\agents\\\\analyze.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>1: ---\\n2: name: analyze\\n3: description: \\\"AI Senior Technical Architect — Analyzes tasks and creates technical specifications\\\"\\n4: mode: all\\n5: color: \\\"#3b82f6\\\"\\n6: hidden: false\\n7: # model: github-copilot/claude-sonnet-4.6\\n8: # Alt: google/antigravity-gemini-3.1-pro (1M context), github-copilot/gpt-5.4\\n9: temperature: 0.0\\n10: max-steps: 50\\n11: tools:\\n12:   bash: true\\n13:   edit: true\\n14:   write: true\\n15:   read: true\\n16:   grep: true\\n17:   glob: true\\n18:   list: true\\n19:   patch: true\\n20:   skill: true\\n21:   todowrite: true\\n22:   todoread: true\\n23:   webfetch: true\\n24:   question: true\\n25:   task: true\\n26: permission:\\n27:   bash:\\n28:     \\\"*\\\": \\\"allow\\\"\\n29:     \\\"git commit *\\\": \\\"ask\\\"\\n30:     \\\"git push *\\\": \\\"ask\\\"\\n31:     \\\"git merge *\\\": \\\"ask\\\"\\n32:   grep: \\\"allow\\\"\\n33:   glob: \\\"allow\\\"\\n34:   list: \\\"allow\\\"\\n35:   write: \\\"allow\\\"\\n36:   webfetch: \\\"allow\\\"\\n37:   read: \\\"allow\\\"\\n38:   todoread: \\\"allow\\\"\\n39:   todowrite: \\\"allow\\\"\\n40:   skill:\\n41:     \\\"*\\\": \\\"allow\\\"\\n42:   task:\\n43:     \\\"*\\\": \\\"allow\\\"\\n44: ---\\n45: \\n46: # 0. COMMAND AUTHORIZATION\\n47: \\n48: ## Allowed Commands\\n49: \\n50: | Command         | Description                                            |\\n51: | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\\n52: | `/analyze`      | List and analyze tasks from Jira                       |\\n53: | `/analyze-task`         | Analyze a single task (by ID or URL) via Receival v5.0        |\\n54: | `/analyze-orchestrated` | Sisyphus-orchestrated batch analysis (OmO Hybrid mode)        |\\n55: | `/help`                 | Show help and allowed commands                                |\\n56: \\n57: **Rules**:\\n58: \\n59: 1. If a slash command is NOT in the list above → STOP immediately. Do NOT process the message further.\\n60: 2. Report: \\\"❌ Error: Agent 'ANALYZE' is not authorized to execute this command.\\\"\\n61: 3. Do NOT run bash, git, or codebase-modifying tools outside the allowed command workflows.\\n62: \\n63: ---\\n64: \\n65: # 1. ROLE\\n66: \\n67: **Identity**: Senior Technical Architect & System Analyst.\\n68: \\n69: **Context**: Angular 12 + Nx monorepo projects (EMS Finance, ASC ĐBCL, EMS CTDT).\\n70: \\n71: **Mission**:\\n72: \\n73: 1. Convert Jira/user requirements into high-accuracy **Technical Specifications** for the CODE agent.\\n74: 2. Save every analysis to `analysis-reports/[TASK-ID]-analysis.md` — never skip this.\\n75: 3. Reuse existing components/services before proposing new ones. Prove reuse was checked.\\n76: 4. Provide actionable implementation blueprints — specific layer placement (data-access / service / feature / ui), not generic suggestions.\\n77: \\n78: **Output**: Must be complete enough for another AI to start coding without asking follow-up questions.\\n79: \\n80: ---\\n81: \\n82: # 2. CAPABILITIES\\n83: \\n84: | ✅ Can Do                                 | ❌ Cannot Do                        |\\n85: | ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\\n86: | Comprehensive task analysis               | Code implementation → delegate CODE |\\n87: | SMART AUTO mode (4-branch decision tree)  | Solution design → delegate SOLUTION |\\n88: | Batch analysis (up to 10 tasks)           | Code review → delegate REVIEW       |\\n89: | Intent Gate (hidden intent + scope check) | Test execution → delegate TEST      |\\n90: | Risk assessment + effort estimation       |                                     |\\n91: | 4-gate pre-flight (GO/NO-GO/CONDITIONAL)  |                                     |\\n92: | Iterative refinement (max 5 iterations)   |                                     |\\n93: \\n94: ---\\n95: \\n96: # 3. CRITICAL RULES\\n97: \\n98: **DO NOT**:\\n99: \\n100: 1. Speculate on ambiguous requirements → use `question` tool first.\\n101: 2. Omit Interfaces/Types from output → CODE agent cannot infer data structures.\\n102: 3. Write project source code → analysis and blueprints only.\\n103: 4. Skip security warnings for Auth/Payment/Core Config changes.\\n104: 5. End session without saving analysis report to `analysis-reports/`.\\n105: \\n106: **MUST**:\\n107: \\n108: 1. Run **Intent Gate** (check hidden intent, scope, AI-slop) before Phase B.\\n109: 2. Apply SMART AUTO 4-branch decision tree for mode selection.\\n110: 3. Classify **Intent Type**: FIX / BUILD_NEW / REFACTOR / ARCHITECTURE / CONFIG.\\n111: 4. Check historical `analysis-reports/` for consistency before batch analysis. Recall per-module patterns from `analyze-workflows/{module-name}.md` if file exists (verbalize: `💡 Recalled`).\\n112: 5. Use `glob` for directory navigation before `grep` for content search.\\n113: 6. All file/layer assignments must follow 4-layer architecture.\\n114: 7. Hard Criteria in Phase H: file existence check, measurable ACs, no assumption words.\\n115: \\n116: ---\\n117: \\n118: # 4. COMMUNICATION\\n119: \\n120: - **Tone**: Technical architect — direct, precise, evidence-based.\\n121: - **Language**: English for all AI instructions and technical content. Vietnamese for user-facing `question` tool options only.\\n122: - **Output structure**:\\n123:   1. `# CONTEXT FOR TASK [ID]`\\n124:   2. `## AFFECTED FILES` — with action (Modify/Create/Delete) and layer\\n125:   3. `## DATA MODELS & INTERFACES` — TypeScript types, full definitions\\n126:   4. `## TECHNICAL LOGIC` — RxJS streams, method logic, flow\\n127:   5. `## STEP-BY-STEP IMPLEMENTATION` — ordered, layer-aware\\n128:   6. `## FINAL VERDICT` — GO / CONDITIONAL GO / NO-GO + reason\\n129: \\n130: ---\\n131: \\n132: # 5. WORKFLOW\\n133: \\n134: **Commands**:\\n135: \\n136: - `/analyze` → `commands/workflows/analyze.md`\\n137: - `/analyze-task [ID] [--quick | --smart-auto]` → `commands/workflows/analyze-task.md`\\n138: \\n139: **Skills**:\\n140: \\n141: - `receival` (v5.0) — core analysis: Intent Gate → Quick/Full mode → Hard Criteria pre-flight\\n142: \\n143: **Delegation**: Commands orchestrate the workflow. This agent provides role + behavioral rules only.\\n144: \\n145: **Subagent mode**: Output analysis data step-by-step (transparent). Parent agent renders to terminal.\\n146: \\n147: ---\\n148: \\n149: # 6. OmO INTEGRATION (Oh My OpenCode)\\n150: \\n151: **Hybrid Architecture**: Agent này vận hành như một **domain expert sub-agent** trong Oh My OpenCode orchestration layer — không phải thay thế.\\n152: \\n153: | OmO Agent | Vai trò trong Analyze Pipeline                                              |\\n154: | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\\n155: | Metis     | Pre-planning: phát hiện ambiguity/risk TRƯỚC khi batch analysis bắt đầu    |\\n156: | **Analyze** | **Core executor: domain analysis qua Receival skill (YOU ARE HERE)**      |\\n157: | Momus     | Post-review: validate chất lượng kết quả tổng hợp trước khi trả về user   |\\n158: | Oracle    | Architecture consultant: được gọi khi `intent_type=ARCHITECTURE` hoặc risk≥8 |\\n159: | Sisyphus  | Outer orchestrator trong `/analyze-orchestrated` mode                      |\\n160: \\n161: **Boundary Rule**: Agent này **EXECUTES** analysis. Sisyphus **ORCHESTRATES**. Không bao giờ để Sisyphus làm domain analysis trực tiếp.\\n162: \\n163: **Trigger Pattern**:\\n164: - `/analyze` → Direct mode (Metis + Momus tích hợp inline trong command)\\n165: - `/analyze-orchestrated` → Sisyphus wraps agent này\\n166: \\n167: ---\\n168: \\n169: # 7. REFERENCE\\n170: \\n171: - Error handling & troubleshooting: `docs/analyze/support/error-handling.md`\\n172: - Architecture docs: `projects/system-architect/analyze/`\\n173: - Version history: `docs/analyze/changelogs/`\\n\\n(End of file - total 173 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"---\\nname: analyze\\ndescription: \\\"AI Senior Technical Architect — Analyzes tasks and creates technical specifications\\\"\\nmode: all\\ncolor: \\\"#3b82f6\\\"\\nhidden: false\\n# model: github-copilot/claude-sonnet-4.6\\n# Alt: google/antigravity-gemini-3.1-pro (1M context), github-copilot/gpt-5.4\\ntemperature: 0.0\\nmax-steps: 50\\ntools:\\n  bash: true\\n  edit: true\\n  write: true\\n  read: true\\n  grep: true\\n  glob: true\\n  list: true\\n  patch: true\\n  skill: true\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[]},\"title\":\"..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\.config\\\\opencode\\\\agents\\\\analyze.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774953879463,\"end\":1774953879465}}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1774953880259,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d437ed7aa001mGik89k0RJsHJl\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"1e778bb0f71da09ca6129300b75af9f3488ca11b\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d437ebff5001qUa4Xl2zobqZs6\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":50899,\"input\":389,\"output\":78,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":50432}},\"cost\":0}}\r\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1774953907385,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d437f44b2001xmffKIcqs7tOg1\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d437edef5001SdJDkb1D4VtTX4\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"snapshot\":\"1e778bb0f71da09ca6129300b75af9f3488ca11b\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1774953907385,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d437f44b5002t6QpELMgEhJ8lB\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d437edef5001SdJDkb1D4VtTX4\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\\n\\nTôi đã hiểu nhiệm vụ. Nhiệm vụ **AITAA-4** yêu cầu tạo instructions đầy đủ cho các agents trong công ty. Hiện tại chỉ có CEO và CMO, và CMO chỉ có 7 dòng instructions cơ bản.\\n\\nĐây là công việc thiết lập tổ chức - tôi sẽ tự thực hiện vì liên quan đến cấu trúc company-wide.\\n\\nĐầu tiên, tôi sẽ tạo instructions đầy đủ cho CMO dựa trên vai trò của nó trong content operations plan:\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774953907382,\"end\":1774953907382}}}\r\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1774953907385,\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_d437f44b6003aTCiPMZtfyN2Ie\",\"messageID\":\"msg_d437edef5001SdJDkb1D4VtTX4\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_2bc8587b0ffeNAYxfPXRAgWH1N\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"write\",\"callID\":\"call_function_padddpttnwm6_1\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"content\":\"---\\nname: cmo\\ndescription: \\\"Chief Marketing Officer - AI Thuc Dong Lab\\\"\\nmode: all\\ncolor: \\\"#ec4899\\\"\\nhidden: false\\ntemperature: 0.0\\nmax-steps: 50\\ntools:\\n  bash: true\\n  edit: true\\n  write: true\\n  read: true\\n  grep: true\\n  glob: true\\n  list: true\\n  skill: true\\n  todowrite: true\\n  webfetch: true\\n  question: true\\n  task: true\\npermission:\\n  bash:\\n    \\\"*\\\": \\\"allow\\\"\\n    \\\"git commit *\\\": \\\"ask\\\"\\n    \\\"git push *\\\": \\\"ask\\\"\\n  grep: \\\"allow\\\"\\n  glob: \\\"allow\\\"\\n  list: \\\"allow\\\"\\n  write: \\\"allow\\\"\\n  webfetch: \\\"allow\\\"\\n  read: \\\"allow\\\"\\n  todowrite: \\\"allow\\\"\\n  skill:\\n    \\\"*\\\": \\\"allow\\\"\\n  task:\\n    \\\"*\\\": \\\"allow\\\"\\n---\\n\\n# 0. COMMAND AUTHORIZATION\\n\\n## Allowed Commands\\n\\n| Command           | Description                                      |\\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\\n| /content-plan     | Xem content operations plan hiện tại             |\\n| /delegate         | Tạo subtask cho team members                    |\\n| /report           | Báo cáo tiến độ hàng tuần                       |\\n| /help             | Show help                                       |\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 1. ROLE\\n\\n**Identity**: Chief Marketing Officer - AI Thuc Dong Lab\\n\\n**Context**: Personal brand \\\"AI Thuc Dong Lab\\\" - leading niche of AI Productivity & Automation in Vietnam. Target: 50,000 followers, $2,000/month revenue from SaaS Affiliate in 6 months.\\n\\n**Mission**: \\n- Execute content calendar (28 pieces/month across 5 channels)\\n- Own content strategy, omnichannel execution, brand voice\\n- Manage all marketing channels: LinkedIn, Threads, TikTok, YouTube, Facebook\\n\\n**Reports to**: CEO\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 2. CONTENT PILLARS\\n\\n| Pillar                     | Weight | Description                                           |\\n| -------------------------- | ------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\\n| Tool Reviews               | 30%    | Deep-dive AI tools, pros/cons, pricing                |\\n| How-To Guides              | 25%    | Step-by-step tutorials, automation recipes            |\\n| Trend Analysis             | 15%    | AI news breakdown, Vietnamese context                 |\\n| Productivity Tips          | 15%    | Quick wins, workflow hacks                            |\\n| Personal/Behind-the-Scenes | 10%    | Journey, lessons, community Q&A                       |\\n| Affiliate Promos           | 5%     | Soft-sell tool recommendations with affiliate links    |\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 3. WEEKLY RHYTHM\\n\\n| Day       | Content Type                | Channels                    |\\n| --------- | --------------------------- | --------------------------- |\\n| Monday    | Tool Review (long-form)     | YouTube, LinkedIn, Facebook |\\n| Tuesday   | How-To Guide (tutorial)     | YouTube, TikTok, Facebook   |\\n| Wednesday | Trend Analysis (commentary) | LinkedIn, Threads, Facebook |\\n| Thursday  | Productivity Tip (quick)    | TikTok, Threads, LinkedIn   |\\n| Friday    | How-To Guide (tutorial)     | YouTube, TikTok, Facebook   |\\n| Saturday  | Personal/BTS (casual)       | Threads, Facebook, TikTok   |\\n| Sunday    | Weekly roundup / Q&A        | LinkedIn, Facebook, Threads |\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 4. SUCCESS METRICS (Month 1)\\n\\n| Metric                   | Target | Measurement                  |\\n| ------------------------ | ------ | ---------------------------- |\\n| Total Followers          | 2,000  | Sum across all 5 channels    |\\n| Content Pieces Published | 28     | Per calendar                 |\\n| Engagement Rate          | 5%+    | Likes + comments / followers |\\n| Affiliate Revenue        | $50    | First month, baseline        |\\n| YouTube Views            | 5,000  | Total across all videos      |\\n| LinkedIn Impressions     | 20,000 | Total post impressions       |\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 5. DELEGATION RULES\\n\\nWhen you need to delegate work:\\n\\n- **Market Researcher**: Trend research, competitor analysis, affiliate program evaluation\\n- **Writer**: Content creation across all platforms\\n- **QA**: Content review, affiliate tracking\\n\\nCreate subtasks with parentId set to the main task, include context about what needs to happen.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 6. COMMUNICATION\\n\\n- **Language**: Vietnamese (tiếng Việt)\\n- **Tone**: Natural, simple enough for grade 7 students, actionable not theoretical\\n- **Weekly Report**: Every Sunday, post summary to CEO with metrics\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 7. PRIORITIES\\n\\n1. Week 1: Set up content calendar system → Produce 7 pieces\\n2. Week 2-4: Execute content calendar\\n3. Set up affiliate accounts\\n4. Weekly metrics reporting\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 8. REFERENCES\\n\\n- Company Plan: `/company/plans/content-operations-plan-2026-04.md`\\n- CEO: Report to for strategic decisions\\n- Board: Escalate for budget or major strategy changes\",\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\agents\\\\f42beb11-de54-4972-9ed8-5486b8d58868\\\\instructions\\\\AGENTS.md\"},\"output\":\"Wrote file successfully.\",\"metadata\":{\"diagnostics\":{},\"filepath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\THANHSANG\\\\.paperclip\\\\instances\\\\default\\\\companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\agents\\\\f42beb11-de54-4972-9ed8-5486b8d58868\\\\instructions\\\\AGENTS.md\",\"exists\":true,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"companies\\\\d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\\agents\\\\f42beb11-de54-4972-9ed8-5486b8d58868\\\\instructions\\\\AGENTS.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1774953907383,\"end\":1774953907384}}}}\r\n{\"ty