 AI Thuc Dong Lab da xong. Day la con so that:\\\\n- YouTube: 320 views, 47 subscribers moi\\\\n- LinkedIn: 1.800 impressions, 89 reactions\\\\n- TikTok: 680 views, 51 follows\\\\n- Threads: 234 engagements\\\\n- Facebook: 512 reach, 28 interactions\\\\n\\\\nNoi dung nao duoc quan tam nhat: Bai \\\\u0027Tu Dong Hoa Email Marketing\\\\u0027 - nhieu nguoi hoi ve link tool nhat.\\\\nNoi dung chua tot: Trend analysis ve GPT-5 - qua ky thuat, can don gian hoa hon.\\\\n\\\\nQ\\\\u0026A OPEN - Hoi bat cu dieu gi! Ve AI tools, tu dong hoa, content marketing, xay personal brand...\\\\nComment cau hoi ben duoi. Toi nay (Chu Nhat) se tra loi tat ca trong livestream 30 phut.\\\\n\\\\n### Threads Post\\\\nTuan 1 done!\\\\n\\\\nSo that: 320 YouTube views, 163 followers moi (5 kenh), 6 bai published.\\\\n\\\\nChua viral. Nhung dang di dung huong.\\\\n\\\\nHoi gi minh cung tra loi: AI tools nao ngon? Workflow tu dong hoa nao dang hoc? Xay kenh bat dau tu dau?\\\\n\\\\nDrop cau hoi xuong day - minh doc het.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## TONG KET DRAFTS\\\\n\\\\n| Ngay | Chu de | Kenh | Status |\\\\n|------|--------|------|--------|\\\\n| Thu Ba | Tu Dong Hoa Email Marketing | YouTube, TikTok, Facebook | Done |\\\\n| Thu Nam | 3 Phim Tat AI Tiet Kiem 2 Gio | TikTok, Threads, LinkedIn | Done |\\\\n| Thu Sau | Tu Dong Hoa Bao Cao Tuan | YouTube, TikTok, Facebook | Done |\\\\n| Thu Bay | Hanh Trinh Xay AI Thuc Dong Lab | Threads, Facebook, TikTok | Done |\\\\n| Chu Nhat | Tong Ket Tuan + Q\\\\u0026A | LinkedIn, Facebook, Threads | Done |\\\\n\\\\nTong: 15 drafts / 15 can tao\\\\n\\\\n## GHI CHU THUC THI\\\\n- Giong van: Tieng Viet tu nhien, de hieu, thuc te\\\\n- Moi bai co it nhat 1 CTA ro rang\\\\n- Affiliate links: Chua dua vao draft (cho AITAA-12 hoan thanh)\\\\n- Thumbnail va visual: Can Writer/Designer tao cho YouTube \\\\u0026 TikTok\\\\n- So lieu trong \\\\u0027Tong ket Chu Nhat\\\\u0027 can cap nhat sau khi publish that\\\\n\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"latestRevisionId\\\":  \\\"6109f4d4-6d75-4c6f-b26d-e70361bf30b7\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"latestRevisionNumber\\\":  1,\\r\\n    \\\"createdByAgentId\\\":  \\\"f42beb11-de54-4972-9ed8-5486b8d58868\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"createdByUserId\\\":  null,\\r\\n    \\\"updatedByAgentId\\\":  \\\"f42beb11-de54-4972-9ed8-5486b8d58868\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"updatedByUserId\\\":  null,\\r\\n    \\\"createdAt\\\":  \\\"2026-04-01T02:37:16.896Z\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"updatedAt\\\":  \\\"2026-04-01T02:37:16.896Z\\\"\\r\\n}\\r\\n\",\"metadata\":{\"output\":\"{\\r\\n    \\\"id\\\":  \\\"67853406-75ea-4b25-b8b1-a60d2a12b600\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"companyId\\\":  \\\"d0cfa69a-7d52-4b25-9f15-2cb36c1effb2\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"issueId\\\":  \\\"9eccb791-0ee4-413c-90d2-b80334f86428\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"key\\\":  \\\"plan\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"title\\\":  \\\"Ke Hoach Draft Noi Dung Tuan 1 - Thu Ba den Chu Nhat\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"format\\\":  \\\"markdown\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"body\\\":  \\\"# Ke Hoach Draft Noi Dung Tuan 1\\\\n\\\\nPham vi: Thu Ba den Chu Nhat (5 bai, 15 drafts)\\\\nContent calendar da xac lap tai: [AITAA-9](/AITAA/issues/AITAA-9)\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## THU BA -- How-To Guide\\\\n**Chu de**: Tu Dong Hoa Email Marketing Voi AI\\\\n**Kenh**: YouTube, TikTok, Facebook\\\\n**Pillar**: How-To Guides (25%)\\\\n\\\\n### YouTube Script (~800 chu)\\\\n**Tieu de**: Tu Dong Hoa Email Marketing Voi AI Trong 10 Phut (Khong Can Code)\\\\n\\\\nHook: \\\\u0027Ban co biet hau het doanh nghiep nho mat 3-4 tieng moi tuan chi de viet email marketing khong? Hom nay minh se chi ban cach dung AI de lam ca chuoi email do trong 10 phut - khong can biet lap trinh.\\\\n\\\\nPhan 1 - Van de thuc te:\\\\nNhieu ban dang lam email marketing kieu cu: ngoi nghi chu de, viet tung email, kiem tra ngu phap, schedule. Mot chuoi 5 email co the mat ca buoi sang.\\\\n\\\\nPhan 2 - Cong thuc tu dong hoa:\\\\nBuoc 1 - Dung ChatGPT tao email sequence:\\\\nPrompt: \\\\u0027Tao cho toi chuoi 5 email welcome sequence cho [san pham]. Moi email: tieu de hap dan, 150-200 tu, CTA ro rang. Giong van than thien, thuc te.\\\\u0027\\\\n\\\\nBuoc 2 - Ket noi voi Mailchimp qua Make.com:\\\\n- Tao scenario: Google Sheets \\\\u003e Make \\\\u003e Mailchimp\\\\n- Khi co subscriber moi \\\\u003e tu dong them vao sequence\\\\n\\\\nBuoc 3 - AB test tieu de voi AI:\\\\nPrompt: \\\\u0027De xuat 5 tieu de email cho chu de X, toi uu cho open rate nguoi Viet Nam\\\\u0027\\\\n\\\\nKet qua thuc te:\\\\n- Thoi gian tao: 45 phut -\\\\u003e 10 phut\\\\n- Open rate tang 12%\\\\n- Chi phi: Make.com plan mien phi (1000 ops/thang)\\\\n\\\\nCTA: Cac tool dung hom nay: ChatGPT (mien phi), Make.com (co goi free). Link o description. Thu di roi comment ket qua nhe!\\\\n\\\\n### TikTok Script (60-90 giay)\\\\nHook: \\\\u00273 buoc tu dong hoa email marketing - khong can code\\\\u0027\\\\n\\\\nBan dang mat bao nhieu gio viet email moi tuan?\\\\nDay la cach minh lam trong 10 phut:\\\\n1. Mo ChatGPT, tao 5 email welcome cho [san pham], 150 chu, co CTA\\\\n2. Copy vao Google Sheet: cot A - ngay gui, cot B - tieu de, cot C - noi dung\\\\n3. Dung Make.com ket noi Sheet voi Mailchimp. Free plan la du!\\\\n\\\\nKet qua: Chuoi email tu chay khi co nguoi subscribe.\\\\nLuu video nay lai de dung nhe!\\\\n\\\\nTags: #AIMarketing #TuDongHoa #EmailMarketing #AIVietnam #ChatGPT\\\\n\\\\n### Facebook Post\\\\nBan dang mat bao nhieu tieng moi tuan cho email marketing?\\\\n\\\\nMinh vua cat giam tu 4 tieng xuong con 10 phut - bang cach ket hop ChatGPT + Make.com.\\\\n\\\\nCong thuc don gian:\\\\n1. Dung ChatGPT tao email sequence (2 phut)\\\\nPrompt: \\\\u0027Tao 5 email welcome sequence cho [san pham]. Giong van than thien. Moi email co 1 CTA ro rang.\\\\u0027\\\\n2. Luu vao Google Sheets: Ngay | Tieu de | Noi dung | Trang thai\\\\n3. Ket noi Make.com voi Mailchimp\\\\n\\\\nChi phi: ChatGPT mien phi + Make.com goi free (1000 ops/thang du dung cho list duoi 1000 nguoi)\\\\n\\\\nBan dang dung tool gi cho email marketing? Comment de minh tu van them nhe!\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## THU NAM -- Productivity Tip\\\\n**Chu de**: 3 Phim Tat AI Tiet Kiem 2 Gio Moi Ngay\\\\n**Kenh**: TikTok, Threads, LinkedIn\\\\n**Pillar**: Productivity Tips (15%)\\\\n\\\\n### TikTok Script (45-60 giay)\\\\nHook: \\\\u00273 phim tat AI minh dung moi ngay - tiet kiem 2 gio\\\\u0027\\\\n\\\\nPhim tat so 1: ChatGPT Voice Mode tren dien thoai.\\\\nThay vi go, ban noi. Tom tat cuoc hop, brainstorm y tuong, tra loi email - tat ca bang giong noi. Nhanh gap 3 lan go phim.\\\\n\\\\nPhim tat so 2: Custom GPT cho cong viec cua ban.\\\\nTao mot GPT rieng voi context ve doanh nghiep cua ban. Khong can giai thich lai tu dau moi lan. Minh co GPT \\\\u0027Email Writer VN\\\\u0027 - moi lan can email, 30 giay la xong.\\\\n\\\\nPhim tat so 3: Perplexity AI thay Google cho research.\\\\nSearch mot cau hoi phuc tap - Perplexity tong hop ket qua va trich dan nguon ngay. Tiet kiem 30 phut research moi ngay.\\\\n\\\\n3 thu nay, dung deu moi ngay: tiet kiem it nhat 2 gio.\\\\nFollow de xem them tips!\\\\n\\\\nTags: #AIProductivity #ChatGPT #WorkSmart #TuDongHoa #AIVietnam\\\\n\\\\n### Threads Post\\\\n3 phim tat AI giup minh tiet kiem 2 gio/ngay:\\\\n\\\\n1. ChatGPT Voice Mode -\\\\u003e noi thay vi go\\\\n2. Custom GPT rieng -\\\\u003e khong can giai thich lai context\\\\n3. Perplexity AI -\\\\u003e research nhanh hon Google\\\\n\\\\nCai nao ban chua thu?\\\\n\\\\n### LinkedIn Post\\\\n**Tieu de**: 3 thay doi nho trong cach dung AI da tiet kiem cho toi 10+ gio/tuan\\\\n\\\\nNhieu nguoi dung ChatGPT nhung van cam thay \\\\u0027khong thay khac biet gi nhieu.\\\\u0027\\\\nVan de thuong khong phai o AI - ma o cach dung.\\\\n\\\\nDay la 3 dieu toi thay doi:\\\\n\\\\n1. Chuyen sang noi thay vi go (Voice Mode)\\\\nToc do noi nhanh gap 3 lan go phim. Brainstorm, tom tat, phac thao y tuong - chi can noi to ra la AI hieu va format lai cho ban.\\\\n\\\\n2. Tao Custom GPT voi context doanh nghiep\\\\nThay vi bat dau moi conversation voi \\\\u0027Toi la [X], doanh nghiep toi lam [Y]...\\\\u0027 - toi tao mot Custom GPT da nhung toan bo context do. Moi lan mo ra la lam duoc viec ngay.\\\\n\\\\n3. Dung Perplexity cho research thay Google\\\\nGoogle tot cho tim URL. Perplexity tot cho cau hoi can tong hop. Research bai viet nay mat 8 phut thay vi 30 phut.\\\\n\\\\nBan dang dung AI tool nao hieu qua nhat trong cong viec?\\\\n\\\\n#AIProductivity #WorkSmart #AITools #VietnamTech\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## THU SAU -- How-To Guide\\\\n**Chu de**: Tu Dong Hoa Bao Cao Tuan Voi Google Sheets + AI\\\\n**Kenh**: YouTube, TikTok, Facebook\\\\n**Pillar**: How-To Guides (25%)\\\\n\\\\n### YouTube Script (~900 chu)\\\\n**Tieu de**: Bao Cao Tuan Tu Dong Chay - Google Sheets + ChatGPT + Make (Khong Can Code)\\\\n\\\\nHook: \\\\u0027Moi tuan ban mat bao lau de lam bao cao? 1 tieng? 2 tieng? Minh se chi ban cach setup 1 lan, sau do bao cao tu dong tao ra moi Thu Sau, khong can ban lam gi.\\\\u0027\\\\n\\\\nPhan 1 - Tai sao bao cao thu cong la lang phi:\\\\nHau het bao cao tuan deu co cau truc giong nhau: da lam gi, so lieu, ke hoach tuan toi, blocker. Neu cau truc giong nhau, tai sao phai viet lai tu dau moi lan?\\\\n\\\\nPhan 2 - Setup he thong tu dong:\\\\nCan: Google Sheets (mien phi) + ChatGPT API + Make.com (goi free)\\\\n\\\\nBuoc 1 - Tao Google Sheet \\\\u0027Nhat ky cong viec\\\\u0027:\\\\nMoi ngay nhap: Ngay | Task hoan thanh | So lieu | Ghi chu (2-3 phut/ngay)\\\\n\\\\nBuoc 2 - Tao prompt template trong Make:\\\\n\\\\u0027Tom tat tuan lam viec tu data sau thanh bao cao professional: [data]. Format: Accomplishments, Metrics, Next week goals, Blockers.\\\\u0027\\\\n\\\\nBuoc 3 - Schedule moi Thu Sau 5pm:\\\\nMake keo data tu Sheet -\\\\u003e ChatGPT API -\\\\u003e bao cao -\\\\u003e gui email\\\\n\\\\nKet qua sau 3 thang dung:\\\\n- Thoi gian lam bao cao: 90 phut -\\\\u003e 2 phut (chi review)\\\\n- Chat luong bao cao dong deu hon\\\\n- Khong bao gio quen gui bao cao nua\\\\n\\\\nCTA: Template Google Sheet va Make scenario - link download mien phi o description!\\\\n\\\\n### TikTok Script (60 giay)\\\\nHook: \\\\u0027Bao cao tuan tu dong chay moi Thu Sau - minh khong lam gi het\\\\u0027\\\\n\\\\nMinh setup cai nay 1 lan, gio moi Thu Sau email bao cao tu ve hom thu.\\\\n\\\\nCan gi: Google Sheets (nhat ky cong viec ngan moi ngay) + Make.com + ChatGPT API\\\\n\\\\nFlow: Thu Sau 5pm -\\\\u003e Make keo data tu sheet -\\\\u003e AI tom tat thanh bao cao -\\\\u003e gui email cho minh.\\\\n\\\\nThoi gian setup: 30 phut 1 lan. Tiet kiem: 90 phut/tuan.\\\\n\\\\nBan co muon minh lam tutorial chi tiet khong? Comment \\\\u0027CO\\\\u0027 ben duoi!\\\\n\\\\nTags: #GoogleSheets #AIAutomation #BaoCao #WorkSmarter #AIVietnam\\\\n\\\\n### Facebook Post\\\\nTu 90 phut xuong con 2 phut - day la cach minh lam bao cao tuan\\\\n\\\\nKhong phai minh viet nhanh hon. Minh de AI viet, minh chi doc va approve.\\\\n\\\\nCach setup:\\\\nNgay thuong (2-3 phut/ngay): Mo Google Sheet -\\\\u003e ghi nhanh: lam duoc gi, so lieu gi, ghi chu gi.\\\\n\\\\nTu dong moi Thu Sau: Make doc sheet -\\\\u003e ChatGPT viet bao cao theo template -\\\\u003e gui email ve hop thu.\\\\n\\\\nKet qua sau 3 thang: Khong bao gio quen bao cao. Chat luong on dinh. Tiet kiem 6 tieng/thang.\\\\n\\\\nChi phi: Make.com mien phi + ChatGPT free.\\\\n\\\\nBan dang dung tool gi de quan ly cong viec tuan? Comment de minh goi y tich hop AI vao workflow nhe!\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## THU BAY -- Personal/BTS\\\\n**Chu de**: Hanh Trinh Xay AI Thuc Dong Lab - Tuan 1\\\\n**Kenh**: Threads, Facebook, TikTok\\\\n**Pillar**: Personal/Behind-the-Scenes (10%)\\\\n\\\\n### Threads Post\\\\nTuan 1 xay AI Thuc Dong Lab - chinh xac nhung gi da xay ra:\\\\n\\\\nThu 2: Setup xong content calendar. Nhin vao 28 bai/thang va tu hoi minh co dien khong.\\\\nThu 3: Publish video dau tien ve email automation. 47 views sau 24 gio.\\\\nThu 4: Viet bai trend analysis ve GPT-5. LinkedIn impression tot hon mong doi.\\\\nThu 5: Productivity tip video. TikTok bat dau suggest cho niche AI.\\\\nThu 6: Tutorial Google Sheets. Comment dau tien xin template. Tang mien p