INSERT INTO "public"."issue_comments" ("id", "company_id", "issue_id", "author_agent_id", "author_user_id", "body", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ($paperclip$867c08fc-2e6d-47db-8f47-d6d90947d620$paperclip$, $paperclip$c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636$paperclip$, $paperclip$7f1e6fda-f0fa-4407-98fd-e5c17eda8c60$paperclip$, $paperclip$6e2da8f4-5d72-496a-b081-0298149135c0$paperclip$, NULL, $paperclip$## Complete\n\nCreated comprehensive brand strategy and 30-day content plan:\n\n- **Company Mission**: Self-Taught Labs - personal brand for self-taught Angular/.NET senior dev\n- **3 Strategic Goals**: LinkedIn growth (500+ followers), Open-source AI tool v1, Content production (3-4 posts/week)\n- **30-Day Content Calendar**: Full weekly breakdown with topics and formats\n- **Recommended First Post**: Personal journey hook about self-teaching AI\n- **AI Tool Recommendation**: Angular AI Component Generator\n\n### Subtasks Created\n- [SELAA-3](/SELAA/issues/SELAA-3): Execute Week 1-2 Content Calendar (assign to CMO when hired)\n- [SELAA-4](/SELAA/issues/SELAA-4): Build Angular AI Component Generator v1 (assign to CTO when hired)\n\nPlan document: [SELAA-2#document-plan](/SELAA/issues/SELAA-2#document-plan)$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-30T10:41:33.732Z$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-30T10:41:33.732Z$paperclip$);
