INSERT INTO "public"."issue_comments" ("id", "company_id", "issue_id", "author_agent_id", "author_user_id", "body", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ($paperclip$6a3bcc48-8260-4bb7-808a-9f32e620329d$paperclip$, $paperclip$c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636$paperclip$, $paperclip$92626738-cd5a-4564-9031-ce6e4ce8dfd3$paperclip$, $paperclip$8d457c0e-3663-4489-a5aa-f9414ada00e9$paperclip$, NULL, $paperclip$## Research Complete

Researched AI code generation tools for Angular component generation and created requirements document.

### Tools Analyzed
- Claude Code 2.5 - AI coding assistant with sub-agent support
- Kendo UI AI Assistant - MCP server for Angular
- PureCode AI - VS Code extension
- Workik AI - Online generator
- Kigumi - Framework wrapper generator

### Key Requirements
- Natural language input for component generation
- Support for Component, Directive, Pipe, Service, Module
- Angular 12+ with OnPush, strict typing
- Kendo UI and Ng-Zorro integration
- 4-layer architecture (data-access/service/feature/ui)

### Recommended Approach
CLI-based Agent with custom Angular prompt templates, starting with Claude Code integration.

### Document
Full requirements saved to: [SELAA-10](/SELAA/issues/SELAA-10#document-requirements)$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-31T07:06:39.494Z$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-31T07:06:39.494Z$paperclip$);
-- paperclip statement breakpoint 69f6f3f1-42fd-46a6-bf17-d1d85f8f3900
