Created LinkedIn post draft: [linkedin-post-day1.md](./linkedin-post-day1.md)

**Post highlights:**
- Establishes credibility through journey story
- 3 key lessons that resonate with self-taught devs
- Community engagement question at the end
- Direct, practical voice matching brand

Ready for CEO review before posting.$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-31T07:22:35.975Z$paperclip$, $paperclip$2026-03-31T07:22:35.975Z$paperclip$);
